INSERT INTO `ti_leads_followup` VALUES (17576,664,'2023-05-25 21:45:00','I had a telephone call with raina and she confirmed the booking. Payment will be settled on Sunday.','2023-05-26 12:00:00','Namita - To Do\r\n1) Get the Cancellation Policy From Ramveer Ji and share confirmation on email. Get the bank details of Supplier.\r\n2) Confirm raina based on cancellation policy.\r\n3) Once confirmed generate vouchers and share it with Raina Solanki. ',1,'2023-05-26 00:19:17','2023-05-26 00:19:17'),(17577,666,'2023-05-25 21:00:00','I had a whats app discussion with Mr. Gaurav and he asked to check the following:-\r\n********\r\nAchha maine ek baat suni kisi reel me ki kashmir me power backup is an issue. So are these hotels providing good backups?\r\n********','2023-05-26 12:00:00','Saching - To Do\r\n\r\nPlease check this from Tourish and ensure information is correct and ask namita to share this information with the guest. \r\n\r\nDont forget to update the status back here again based on your conversation. all leads should have updated status always. ',1,'2023-05-26 00:23:01','2023-05-26 00:23:01'),(17578,657,'2023-05-25 14:00:00','I had a whats app chat with Guest and she expressed her interest as selected destination as bali.','2023-05-26 14:00:00','Namita :- Need to send bali quotation asap. We are already late on the same and we should had to send this yesterday itself. Please expedite this and ensure quotation release before lunch time. I have marked that as due time. Friday saturday and sunday always crucial.',1,'2023-05-26 05:41:32','2023-05-26 05:41:32'),(17579,666,'2023-05-26 07:00:00','I sent the following message on whats app to the guest.\r\n\r\nGM - Yes Namita is working on this. She will update back and coordinate whatever needed. Flights are pre purchased and non refundable and non changable. \r\n\r\nDifference between pre purchased fare vs system fare was around 10k. I asked her to consider pre purchase fare. Rest we can discuss.\r\n\r\n All fares are dynamic and keeps on changing.\r\n\r\nJust thought to inform you. \r\n\r\nThx','2023-05-26 13:00:00','Namita to take action based on information shared with guestand followup and push to close after clarifying electricity doubts. Be carful in verifying the information , what is asked.',1,'2023-05-26 07:41:43','2023-05-26 07:41:43'),(17582,615,'2023-05-25 14:00:00','Ritika informed about missing payment but later got the confirmation and STS team asked to release vouchers. ','2023-05-27 14:00:00','@Namita - Please get the vouchers out and share it with SNYK. Move the lead to deal. ',1,'2023-05-26 11:27:10','2023-05-26 11:27:10'),(17583,664,'2023-05-26 13:00:00','Got the call from Mr. ramveer. there is no issue as recalling message was to change some agent name wrongly mentioned. There is no problem with the booking. ','2023-05-26 19:00:00','I am going to make the payment once Namita confirms after discussing with Raina for the cancellation policy and move this from lead to deal. ',1,'2023-05-26 12:59:35','2023-05-26 12:59:35'),(17584,671,'2023-05-26 12:42:00','I called Sonia and she asked me to drop an email.','2023-05-26 13:04:00','I have dropped an email regarding the Quotation for Kashmir in Tourish.',17297,'2023-05-26 13:06:10','2023-05-26 13:06:10'),(17585,671,'2023-05-26 12:42:00','I called Sonia and she asked me to drop an email.','2023-05-26 13:04:00','I have dropped an email regarding the Quotation for Kashmir in Tourish.',17297,'2023-05-26 13:06:16','2023-05-26 13:06:16'),(17586,655,'2023-05-26 13:00:00','Yogesh Called up to enquire about the status as its already delayed. ','2023-05-26 14:00:00','Namita - Sachin confirmed that they are going to share both version of quotations around 2 pm with yogesh. Please keep the markup and keep his 15K as markup and inform him before hand. if he says to increase more then add it. our markup should be 15 K on this. ',1,'2023-05-26 13:14:14','2023-05-26 13:14:14'),(17587,647,'2023-05-26 13:27:00','System reminder sent','2023-05-28 13:27:00','will call him after 2 days',15991,'2023-05-26 13:28:22','2023-05-26 13:28:22'),(17588,649,'2023-05-26 13:29:00','System reminder sent','2023-05-29 14:00:00','Will give him a call on Monday as his travel was planned for later this year',15991,'2023-05-26 13:31:40','2023-05-26 13:31:40'),(17601,655,'2023-05-26 16:30:00','Shared one version ','2023-05-26 18:00:00','will share another option',15991,'2023-05-26 18:02:13','2023-05-26 18:02:13'),(17602,655,'2023-05-26 18:02:00','Shared second option','2023-05-28 18:02:00','Will follow up',15991,'2023-05-26 18:02:52','2023-05-26 18:02:52'),(17610,642,'2023-05-26 20:00:00','Asked him to process the payment after explaining everything.','2023-05-27 13:00:00','Will ask him to pay the amount',15991,'2023-05-27 10:02:37','2023-05-27 10:02:37'),(17611,654,'2023-05-27 10:30:00','System reminder sent','2023-05-28 10:30:00','will call him',15991,'2023-05-27 10:31:28','2023-05-27 10:31:28'),(17612,664,'2023-05-27 14:00:00','Made the 100% payment to Club Mahindra Resort for the booking. ','2023-05-27 18:00:00','Namita to do :-\r\n1) Ensure payment received.\r\n2) Get the confirmation.\r\n3) Generate vouchers and sent to Ms Raina\r\n4) After check out collect invoice. \r\n\r\nLead should be moved to deal. ',1,'2023-05-27 13:38:22','2023-05-27 13:38:22'),(17613,657,'2023-05-27 01:30:00','Messaged Client about bali quotation which was sent on 26th May around 9:30 pm. Now she said there are some changes to be made. ','2023-05-29 15:00:00','will discuss the changes',15991,'2023-05-27 14:43:28','2023-05-27 14:43:28'),(17614,654,'2023-05-28 11:00:00',' He didn\'t pick up the call','2023-05-28 13:00:00','Will drop him a whatsapp msg',15991,'2023-05-28 11:17:33','2023-05-28 11:17:33'),(17615,660,'2023-05-28 11:00:00','I called her. she said she is busy will call back later','2023-05-29 13:00:00','Will wait for her call or will send her reminder ',15991,'2023-05-28 11:18:51','2023-05-28 11:18:51'),(17621,647,'2023-05-29 1