o his response.',15991,'2023-05-31 16:51:07','2023-05-31 16:51:07'),(17675,676,'2023-05-31 20:00:00','Updated quotation sent with one more day in singapore and universal studios ','2023-06-01 18:00:00','will follow up ',15991,'2023-05-31 20:01:57','2023-05-31 20:01:57'),(17676,683,'2023-05-31 19:00:00','After sharing the quoation, had a telephonice discussion with the client. There are changes requested. ','2023-07-01 12:00:00','There are following amendments are needed in quotation. Please take this up with Tourish and get the updated quotation out. \r\n\r\n1) Flight Timmings to be changed. Its too early to leave and return flight needed little late. \r\n2) Flight fare to be mentioned seperately. Please check the system fare and smartly position the flight fare. \r\n3) 5th night not needed in houseboat but need but standard good hotel near dal lake. \r\n4) Shikara Ride needs to be added seperately.\r\n5) Chandanwari, Betab Valley and Aru Valley cost needs to be added in the quotation. \r\n6) Hotel Availability needs to be checked as if client confirms then we will have to issue the flights.  \r\n\r\nPlease get this ready asap. ',1,'2023-05-31 20:17:00','2023-05-31 20:17:00'),(17677,572,'2023-05-31 12:00:00','Discussed internally today. ','2023-05-31 21:00:00','System reminder set to the client. Waiting for revert. Namita to followup once else will close this query tomorrow. ',1,'2023-05-31 21:26:24','2023-05-31 21:26:24'),(17678,615,'2023-05-31 12:00:00','Discussed internally today. ','2023-06-01 18:00:00','Not sure about voucher sending status and visa query clarification. Need to close everything asap. ',1,'2023-05-31 21:27:42','2023-05-31 21:27:42'),(17679,638,'2023-05-31 12:00:00','Discussed today. ','2023-06-01 18:00:00','Sachin to ensure quotation is shared with the guest. This is pending for one month now. We will close this query if quotation is not sent to the client. ',1,'2023-05-31 21:28:53','2023-05-31 21:28:53'),(17680,646,'2023-05-31 19:00:00','Shortf