5','2024-03-04 19:14:15'),(18866,996,'2024-03-08 18:11:00','He told me that he will tell me tomorrow after confirming with 1 more person who may join them from Delhi','2024-03-09 18:11:00','So will follow up accordingly',15991,'2024-03-08 18:12:29','2024-03-08 18:12:29'),(18867,995,'2024-03-08 18:13:00','He didn\'t pick up the call. ','2024-03-10 18:13:00','Will call him tomorrow or day after tomorrow',15991,'2024-03-08 18:14:18','2024-03-08 18:14:18'),(18868,994,'2024-03-08 18:15:00','Dropped him message. ','2024-03-10 18:15:00','Will wait for his message and take action accordingly.',15991,'2024-03-08 18:19:13','2024-03-08 18:19:13'),(18883,1003,'2024-03-10 15:55:00','Called her to inquire about package if she has checked it or not. She said she has checked but not finalized yet. ','2024-03-12 15:55:00','Will check with her after a day or two. Maybe on tuesday',15991,'2024-03-10 15:56:50','2024-03-10 15:56:50'),(18946,1000,'2024-03-12 12:29:00','I called him up but he disconnected the call. I have dropped him message as well\r\n','2024-03-13 12:29:00','Will wait for his response or will call him tomorrow again',15991,'2024-03-12 12:30:35','2024-03-12 12:30:35'),(18953,984,'2024-03-12 12:46:00','He said the person who wanted the package is out of town for 2-3 days. He will let me know once he will be back','2024-03-15 12:46:00','Will call him after 3 days only',15991,'2024-03-12 12:47:18','2024-03-12 12:47:18'),(19004,969,'2024-03-13 16:23:00','I called him up. he said most probably the plan will get final for june. He has a meeting with client in next week.','2024-03-13 16:24:00','Will call him after 20th march',15991,'2024-03-13 16:26:39','2024-03-13 16:26:39'),(19005,975,'2024-03-13 16:27:00','Called him but his number was busy so dropped him a message too if the travel plan is still there or not. ','2024-03-14 16:27:00','Will wait for his revert for  2 days otherwise we will close the lead',15991,'2024-03-13 16:28:36','2024-03-13 16:28:36'),(19006,977,'2024-03-13 16:29:00','He took the package from someone else. ','2024-03-13 16:29:00','need to close the lead',15991,'2024-03-13 16:30:34','2024-03-13 16:30:34'),(19007,981,'2024-03-13 16:33:00','We can keep it open for a week or so. ','2024-03-18 16:33:00','I will check with Kunal if we need to keep this query opened or close. then we can take necessary action.',15991,'2024-03-13 16:35:50','2024-03-13 16:35:50'),(19012,975,'2024-03-14 18:41:00','Her father called me on his own and shared his daughter\'s expired passport which was the reason to postpone the trip. he said he will get back to us after 15-20 days once he gets the renewed passport. ','2024-03-21 18:41:00','His destination may get changed so we can close the lead as of now',15991,'2024-03-14 18:42:49','2024-03-14 18:42:49'),(19013,978,'2024-03-13 18:50:00','I have moved the lead into deal','2024-03-14 18:50:00','it can be closed now',15991,'2024-03-14 18:51:27','2024-03-14 18:51:27'),(19014,987,'2024-03-14 18:54:00','moved into deal','2024-03-14 18:54:00','it can be closed now',15991,'2024-03-14 18:56:09','2024-03-14 18:56:09'),(19015,1013,'2024-03-14 18:57:00','I called her up and she disconnected the call','2024-03-14 18:57:00','we can wait for a day or two. I will call her again tomorrow',15991,'2024-03-14 18:58:24','2024-03-14 18:58:24'),(19016,996,'2024-03-14 19:16:00','Moved into the deal and shared the vouchers with client','2024-03-14 19:16:00','it can be removed from the list',15991,'2024-03-14 19:16:58','2024-03-14 19:16:58'),(19017,990,'2024-03-14 19:18:00','the plan is cancelled','2024-03-14 19:18:00','query can be closed',15991,'2024-03-14 19:18:41','2024-03-14 19:18:41'),(19018,1002,'2024-03-14 19:28:00','Sent system reminder','2024-03-14 19:29:00','we can wait for few more days if he reverts',15991,'2024-03-14 19:29:28','2024-03-14 19:29:28'),(19019,1008,'2024-03-14 19:30:00','Her husband picked up the call and said she will call back in some time','2024-03-14 19:30:00','will wait and try reaching out to her day after tomorrow',15991,'2024-03-14 19:48:36','2024-03-14 19:48:36'),(19020,1006,'2024-03-15 19:20:00','He didn\'t pick up the call. ','2024-03-15 19:20:00','Will call him after 2 days',15991,'2024-03-15 19:20:37','2024-03-15 19:20:37'),(19021,1006,'2024-03-15 19:20:00','He didn\'t pick up the call. ','2024-03-15 19:20:00','Will call him after 2 days',15991,'2024-03-15 19:20:45','2024-03-15 19:20:45'),(19022,1011,'2024-03-15 19:22:00','He has booked the package for udaipur from somewhere else','2024-03-15 19:22:00','need to close the lead',15991,'2024-03-15 19:23:53','2024-03-15 19:23:53'),(19023,1013,'2024-03-15 19:25:00','She is not picking up the call. ','2024-03-15 19:25:00','need to wait for a day or two',15991,'2024-03-15 19:26:35','2024-03-15 19:26:35'),(19024,1012,'2024-03-15 19:28:00','I offered 6 options in total with her. Today i offered her neemrana. And when i asked her after 2 hours which one she has finalized then she said she will tell tomorrow. ','2024-03-15 19:28:00','So will check with her tomorrow ',15991,'2024-03-15 19:34:36','2024-03-15 19:34:36'),(19028,1004,'2024-03-18 13:11:00','He is not picking up the call.','2024-03-18 13:11:00','we can close the lead. called him multiple times',15991,'2024-03-18 13:11:43','2024-03-18 13:11:43'),(19029,1014,'2024-03-18 13:31:00','Neha mam asked me howz the property Avenue 18. And asked me to check divine resort','2024-03-18 13:31:00','Checking the option',15991,'2024-03-18 13:34:34','2024-03-18 13:34:34'),(19035,1010,'2024-03-19 14:15:00','Yesterday i dropped a message to her but she didn\'t reply and today i called her but her number was busy. ','2024-03-19 14:15:00','will try her number tomorrow',15991,'2024-03-19 14:15:53','2024-03-19 14:15:53'),(19036,1017,'2024-03-19 14:17:00','yesterday shared goa quote with him and today i have dropped him a message to check if the quotation is fine for him','2024-03-19 14:17:00','Will wait for his revert and act accordingly. ',15991,'2024-03-19 14:18:33','2024-03-19 14:18:33'),(19037,1012,'2024-03-19 14:20:00','Yesterday also we offered her 2 options but with a small amount of markup because of no deal available on these hotels. I called her up today to check if she has finalized. but she disconnected the call and messaged me that she will call me later','2024-03-19 14:20:00','Will wait for her call at least for a day',15991,'2024-03-19 14:21:46','2024-03-19 14:21:46'),(19055,1018,'2024-03-20 14:29:00','I called him today to check if he has checked the quotation but he said it is on higher side. Still he will check with his friends and tell the plan','2024-03-20 14:29:00','Will wait for his call or will call him today evening',15991,'2024-03-20 14:30:35','2024-03-20 14:30:35'),(19056,1012,'2024-03-20 18:11:00','Dropped her a message for finalization but no response yet. Messaged her 1.5 hr ago','2024-03-20 18:11:00','Will wait for her response.',15991,'2024-03-20 18:12:14','2024-03-20 18:12:14'),(19057,1018,'2024-03-21 15:58:00','I received message from client that his friends found it too costly and canceled the plan. ','2024-03-21 15:58:00','So we can close the lead. Though i have asked him if he wants to try any other location.',15991,'2024-03-21 15:59:48','2024-03-21 15:59:48');
