ame sound & light show                                                                 Rs. 1700 per vehicle\r\n\r\n \r\nCANCELLATION POLICY:\r\nÄ  Prior to 45 days or more - 30% of tour cost\r\nÄ  Between 44 and 31 days of departure - 50% of tour cost\r\nÄ  Between 30 and 20 days of departure - 50% of tour cost\r\nÄ  Between 20 days and 10 prior to the date of departure - 75%\r\nÄ  Between 10 days and In case of no show - 100%\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE: Guest should carry COVID -19 negative test report of 96 hours prior to arrival date\r\n \r\nPlease note that COVID RT-PCR negative report is compulsory to enter Leh-Ladakh\r\n\r\nCOVID rapid test is not acceptable and in case you fail to provide RT-PCR Report, you will be quarantined for 7 days.\r\n \r\nTravelers who have had both vaccination and 15 days have passed since last dose are not required to furnish negative report. They can come with the hard copy of the vaccination certificate.\r\n \r\n ','2022-05-22','2022-05-27',1,0,0,'2022-03-20 22:49:37','2022-03-26 01:36:24'),(52,217,15567,11,0,0,289300,30000,'Amazing Nepal','07 Night 08 Days Kathmandu, Pokhara & Chitwan Tour Package\r\n\r\nNumber of Pax:		11 Adults \r\n\r\nNationality:		Indian\r\n\r\nNumber of Room:		05 Double & 01 Extra Bed Room\r\n\r\nArrival Date:		14 April 2022\r\n\r\nDeparture Date:		21 April 2022\r\n\r\nVehicle:		A/C Totyta Hiace\r\n\r\nHotel Category		Four Star\r\n\r\nHotel:			Hotel Ramada (Similar), Kathmandu 3 Nights (MAP Plan)\r\n\r\n			Hotel Bodhi Suites & SPA (Similar) , Pokhara 2 Nights (MAP Plan\r\n\r\n                        Hotel Park Safari (Similar), Chitwan,  2 Nights  (AP Plan)\r\n\r\nPackage itinerary\r\n\r\n14 April 2022:\r\n\r\n Pickup from Kathmandu International Airport and drop at hotel.\r\n\r\n Welcome soft drink at hotel.\r\n\r\n Dinner at hotel.\r\n\r\n Overnight stay at hotel in Kathmandu.\r\n\r\n15 April 2022:\r\n\r\n Morning breakfast at hotel.\r\n\r\n Full day sightseeing at Kathmandu covering Pashupatinath Temple, Bauddhanath