orld famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDay 4\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Sonmarg hotel, (Meadows of Gold), it has sheer scenic splendour. The very way-a metalled road snakes through massive mountains laden with forests and firs. After a breath-taking journey from Srinagar you come across River Sindh that is abounded with trout & Mahseer. Onwards the valley opens up to a meadow. After Check-in  Ponies can be hired for a trip up to Thajiwas glacier ; a major attraction during the summer months. Sonamarg\'s importance lies in the fact that it is the last halt on the Kashmir side for the drive from Srinagar to Leh. You will be fascinated to see Snowy Mountains against a cerulean sky against its backdrop. Overnight stay at hotel in Sonmarg.\r\n\r\nDay 5\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDay 6\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat .After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.','','Accommodation on twin/double/triple sharing basis\r\n\r\n✔ Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\n\r\n✔ Airport/station pick-up and drop facility as confirmed by the travelers. \r\n\r\n✔ Sightseeing by non-AC Swift Dzire/Etios/Tavera/Innova Tempo as per the package selected. \r\n\r\n✔ Cost of Shikara Ride.\r\n\r\n✔ Driver Allowances.\r\n\r\n✔ Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n\r\n✔ Hotel Taxes\r\n','✔ Any Air/Train/Bus fare or travel insurance.\r\n\r\n✔ 5% GST on total package cost.\r\n\r\n✔ Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n\r\n✔ Extra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifically mentioned under the head “Prices included”. \r\n\r\n✔ Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n\r\n✔ Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances. \r\n\r\n✔ Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n\r\n✔Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n\r\n✔ Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc. \r\n\r\n✔ Any expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc. \r\n\r\n✔ The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow. \r\n\r\n','','2022-04-25','2022-04-30',1,0,0,'2022-04-21 12:27:32','2022-04-21 12:27:32'),(67,269,3511,5,3,0,418300,62800,'Amazing Nort east,Amazing North East',' No. of Adults : 05\r\n\r\nNo of Child : 3\r\n\r\nMeal Plan : CP\r\n\r\nDAY 01 NJP RAILWAY STATION / IXB (BAGDOGRA AIRPORT) - GANGTOK \r\n      \r\nArrival at NJP Railway Station / Bagdogra Airport. Transfer to Gangtok (5500 ft /130 kms / 04 hrs). Over night at Hotel at Gangtok\r\n\r\nDAY 02     TSANGU LAKE , BABA MANDIR AND NATHULA PASS\r\n\r\nA day excursion to Tsangu Lake (departure at 0700 to 0730 AM hrs ) - situated at a height of 3,780 Mts. with an average  depth of 50 ft  ,  Baba Mandir  and Nathula Pass- The shrine maid in memory of sepoy Harbahajan Singh, Back to Gangtok. Evening free. Over night stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDAY 03 GANGTOK-LACHUNG\r\n\r\nPick-up from hotel at Gangtok at about 10 a.m. proceed to Lachung (124 Kms / 06 Hrs) at an altitude of 9,600 ft. On the way stop and enjoy a few wonderful locations like Tashi View Point, Kabi Lungstok, Naga Waterfalls, the confluence of Lachen-Chu and Lachung- Chu at Chungthang, Twin Waterfalls  and  Bhim Nala Waterfalls You are likely to reach Lachung at late afternoon / in the evening and will check in our hotel.\r\n\r\nDAY 04 LACHUNG – YUMTHANG –ZERO POENT- GANGTOK \r\nAfter breakfast full day excursion to Yumthang Valley , Hot Spring and Zero Poent (11800 ft / 02 hrs). After lunch, transfer to Gangtok (124 kms / 06 hrs). Over night at Hotel.\r\n\r\nDAY 05             GANGTOK- PELLING\r\nAfter breakfast transfer to Pelling (5500 ft / 135 kms / 5½ hrs).afternoon visit. Pemayangtse Monastery, Rabdentse Ruins, New Helipad & View Tower.Evening free for leisure. Over night at Hotel.\r\n\r\nDAY 06       PELLING- DARJEELING\r\nAfter breakfast transfer to Darjeeling (7100 ft/115 kms /4½ hrs)arrival check in Hotel . Evening free for leisure. Overnight at Hotel.\r\n\r\nDAY 07    DARJEELING \r\nEarly Morning at 0400 AM visit Tiger Hill ,famous for sunrise over Mt. Kanchendzonga back to Hotel. After breakfast proceed for visit Mix points, covering The Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, PNZ Zoological Park (closed on Thursday) Tenzing Rock, Tibetans Refuge Centre (closed on Sunday), Tea Garden (outer view), Rope way, Japanese Temple, Ava Art Gallary & Peace pagoda. Overnight stay at hotel\r\n\r\nDAY 08           MIRIK EXCURSION \r\nAfter Breakfast proceed for Mirik Lake Excursion (Boating & Horse Riding is available on direct payment basis) en-route visit Pashupati Market (Indo-Nepal Border). Evening come back to Darjeeling and overnight stay at Hotel. \r\n\r\nDAY 09     DARJELLING – NJP RAILWAY STATION / IXB AIRPORT\r\nAfter breakfast leave Darjeeling and proceed towards – NJP railway station / Bagdogra Airport (110 kms / 03 hrs) for your onward journey.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','PACKKAGE COST INCLUDES- HOTEL ACCOMODATION