GRA AIRPORT) - GANGTOK                          \r\nArrival at NJP Railway Station / Bagdogra Airport. Transfer to Gangtok (5500 ft /125 kms / 04 hrs). Evening free on leisure. Over night at Hotel at Gangtok.\r\n \r\nDAY 02             TSANGU LAKE  & BABA MANDIR                                                                                                     \r\nMorning proceed for an excursion to Tshangu Lake & Baba Mandir (12400 ft / 54 kms / 03 hrs). Evening back to Gangtok. Overnight at Hotel.\r\n \r\nDAY 03             GANGTOK- DARJEELING\r\nAfter breakfast go for local sightseeing covering Ban-Jhakri Water Falls, Research Institute of Tibetology (Closed on Sunday & govt. Holidays), Do-Drul Chorten, Directorate of Handicrafts & Handloom (Closed on Sunday & Govt. Holidays) & Flower Show. Afternoon transfer to Darjeeling (7100 ft / 115 kms / 4½ hrs). Evening free for leisure. Over night at Hotel.\r\n \r\nDAY 04 DARJEELING\r\nEarly Morning at 0400 AM visit Tiger Hill ,famous for sunrise over Mt. Kanchendzonga back to Hotel. After breakfast proceed for visit Mix points, covering The Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, PNZ Zoological Park (closed on Thursday) Tenzing Rock, Tibetans Refuge Centre (closed on Sunday), Tea Garden (outer view), Rope way, Japanese Temple, Ava Art Gallary & Peace pagoda. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n \r\nDAY 05 DARJELLING – NJP RAILWAY STATION / IXB AIRPORT\r\nAfter breakfast leave Darjeeling and proceed towards – NJP railway station / Bagdogra Airport (110 kms / 03 hrs) for your onward journey.\r\n ','Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions.','','2022-06-06','2022-06-10',0,0,0,'2022-05-08 13:53:04','2022-05-08 13:53:04'),(75,281,16224,4,1,0,0,0,'Dharamshala-Dalhousie','ITINERARY:\r\nDay 1: Delhi/Chandigarh-Dharamshala( 470KM -9-11HRS)\r\nDay 2: Dharamshala Local Enjoy a scrumptious breakfast and gear up to kick-start your Dharamshala itinerary with an exciting day tour to Mcleodganj. Explore places like the Bhagsu Nag Temple, Lord Shiva’s Temple, Bhagsu Nag waterfall, St. John\'s Church, and the Talho Sunset Point which are the major tourist attractions in Mcleodganj.\r\nDay 3: Dharamshala: Gear up for Palampur excursion :Relish a toothsome breakfast and set out an exhilarating excursion of yet another gem of a destination - Palampur, as planned by your Dharamshala itinerary. Indulge in a full-day tour filled with exciting experiences which include a visit to the Chamunda Devi Temple, Palampur tea gardens, and Gopalpur Zoo. Later in the afternoon, drive back to Dharamshala and enjoy the rest of the day all by yourself and call it a night with an amazing dinner and a comfortable overnight stay.\r\nDay 4 : Dharamshal – Dalhousie.(130 kms / 3-4 hrs)\r\nAfter breakfast check out from the hotel and drive to Dalhousie (130 Kilometers). Dalhousie is popular hill station situated at 2040 mts in the outer slop of the Dhauladhar range of Himachal Pradesh. On arrival, Check in to the hotel. \r\nDAY-5: Dalhousie – Khajjiar – Dalhousie (25 kms)\r\nMorning drive to Khajjiar, one of the most scenic Plateau known as the mini Switzerland of India and is surrounded by dense pine and deodar forests. There is a small lake in the center with a floating island and 9-hole golf course here. Enjoy zorbing & paragliding. Return to hotel. overnight stay in Dalhousie.\r\nDAY-6: Dalhousie Delhi/Chandigarh: check out from the hotel and drive to Delhi (550 Kilometers) by cab. Reach in Delhi in the evening time and drop at Railway station or Airport as desire','','Inclusions:\r\n•         Meet and greet upon arrival \r\n•         Pickup and Drop from – Delhi\r\n•         Accommodation as mentioned above with MAP Plan\r\n•         Toll and taxes \r\n•         Parking charges \r\n•         Driver allowances \r\n•         24/7 over the Phone support \r\n•         Transfers & sightseeing by Innova','Cost Exclusions:\r\n•         Monument Entrance Fee / Camera Fees.\r\n•         Any Adventure Activities and Personal Expenses\r\n•          Insurance and medical evacuation\r\n•         Any expenses caused by reasons beyond our control such as roadblock due to natural calamity and accidents. Etc\r\n•         Tips, Hard & Soft drinks, Mineral Water, Laundry, Postage, Telephone Calls, anything not specified above and any item of personal nature.','Terms & Conditions:-\r\n•         Rates and availability are subject to change at the time of confirmation.\r\n•         The package does not include guide services\r\n•         Refund on cancellation strictly depends upon the concerned cancellation policy of Hotel & Cab.  \r\n•         NGT  Term and Conditions Apply : A/C will not be used in hilly Areas.','2022-06-05','2022-06-10',0,0,0,'2022-05-08 22:19:46','2022-05-08 22:19:46'),(76,283,54,3,1,0,0,0,'Amazing Singapore','No. of Pax: 4\r\nAdults: 3\r\nChild: 1\r\nStay Duration: 8 nights\r\nMeal Plan: CPAI\r\n','','08 Nights Stay\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\nReturn Airport Transfers on PVT\r\nHalf Day City Tour\r\nNight Safari Tour\r\nUniversal Studio\r\nSentosa Island (01 Way Cable Car + Madam Tussauds + IOS + Boat Ride + 4D Marvel + Luge & Skyride(2rides) + SEA Aquarium)\r\nSingapore Zoo\r\nGardens by the bay (2 Domes)\r\nAll Tours & Transfers by Private Vehicle','Charges does not include:\r\n- Expenses of personal nature, such as: Laundry, telephone calls, mini-bar bills, etc.\r\n- Any other tours apart from those listed under inclusions','Terms & Conditions -\r\n- The Above quote is valid for the number of pax indicated above.\r\n- Child age is mandatory to share as few hotels charge extra bed above 6 years of age.\r\n- No booking has been made. Rooms & rates are subject to availability.\r\n- Marina Bay Sands rates are dynamic.\r\n- Mid-night Surcharge applicable from 11pm - 07am on Private Transfers.\r\n- Gardens By The Bay (Cloud Forest) close-out dates : 04-Apr, 09-May, 13-Jun, 25-Jul, 22-Aug, 19-Sep, 10-Oct, 14-Nov, 12-Dec.\r\n- Gardens By The Bay (Flower Dome) close-out dates : 05-Apr, 10-May, 14-Jun, 26-Jul, 23-Aug, 20-Sep, 11-Oct, 15-Nov, 13-Dec.\r\n\r\n\r\nSpecial Request:\r\nAny special request such as early check-in / late check-out is subject to availability upon arrival and solely depends on hotel discretion.\r\nBedding is subject to availability at the time of check-in. We can only pass remarks to the hotel.\r\n ','2022-05-31','2022-06-09',0,0,0,'2022-05-09 17:49:32','2022-05-09 17:49:32'),(77,285,15496,2,0,0,10700,11700,'Manali Adventure','24-06-2022: Overnight travel from Delhi to Manali through Volvo Bus.\r\n\r\n25-06-2022 (Day 1): Arrival at Manali Bus Stop and Transfer to Accommodation through Car. Rest at hotel and then visit to local market in the evening.\r\n                    Dinner and overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\n26-06-2022 (Day 2): After breakfast, Visit to Manikaran. Return to hotel at night. Dinner and overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\n27-06-2022 (Day 3): After breakfast, Visit to Solang Valley and Atal Tunnel. Dinner and overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\n28-06-2022 (Day 4): Transfer through car from hotel to Manali Bus Stop. Departure to Delhi through Volvo.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* Delhi-Manali-Delhi travel through Volvo bus.\r\n* Transfer from Bus Stop to hotel and from Hotel to Bus Stop \r\n* All local sightseeing through car\r\n* 3 breakfast and 3 dinner\r\n* Hotel accommodation\r\n* All taxes ','Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions.','','2022-06-25','2022-06-28',0,0,0,'2022-05-13 20:29:16','2022-05-14 12:46:56'),(78,288,6,14,0,0,43000,3000,'Delhi-Agra-Jaipur','Day 1: Arrive at Delhi and Hotel Check-In. Proceed for Delhi Sightseeing. \r\n\r\nDay 2: After breakfast by 9 am, drive to Agra (4 hrs). Then, visit to Taj Mahal and Agra Fort.\r\n\r\nDay 3: After breakfast, leave for Fatehpur Sikri. \r\n\r\nDay 4: After breakfast by 9 am, drive to Jaipur (5 hrs). Then, visit to City Palace, Hawa Mahal and Jantar Mantar.\r\n\r\nDay 5: After breakfast, visit to Amber fort and Nahargarh fort. \r\n\r\nDay 6: After breakfast, drive back to Delhi.\r\n','','* Hotel Accomodation for 5N/6D\r\n* 5 Breakfast\r\n* All road transfers\r\n* All applicable taxes','* Any tour guide\r\n* Any monument entry fee\r\n* Lunch/ Dinner\r\n* Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions.','','2022-10-04','2022-10-09',0,0,0,'2022-05-16 17:31:36','2022-05-25 14:17:36'),(79,291,15526,2,0,0,125500,15000,'Amazing Kashmir','No of Pax : 02\r\n\r\nCheck in : 27/05/2022\r\n\r\nCheck Out : 30/05/2022\r\n\r\n\r\nARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING (CHECK-IN HOTEL)\r\n\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n	\r\n	\r\nPAHALGAM DAY TRIP FROM SRINAGAR\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Pahalgam, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS “ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n	\r\n	\r\nCHECK-IN AT GULMARG (1 NIGHT STAY)\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as “Meadow Of Flowers “ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg.\r\n\r\nDay :- 4 after breakfast check out from hotel and proceed to onwards destination\r\n','',' Transfer and Sightseeing as per the below tour Itinerary by Non A/C Vehicle.\r\n\r\n• Welcome drink on arrival.\r\n\r\n• Meals MAPAI (Breakfast And Dinner)\r\n\r\n• Transport by Non AC Private Innova.\r\n\r\n• All toll taxes, driver’s allowances, Fuel charges, interstate permit if necessary and all taxes.\r\n','• Any sightseeing or excursion that is not mentioned in the itinerary.\r\n\r\n• Monument Fee, Guide, other expenses not mentioned in inclusion.\r\n\r\n• Any item of personal requirement, such as drinks, laundry, telephone, etc.\r\n\r\n• Any medical or evacuation expenses.\r\n\r\n• Any expenses occur due to natural climate, security and other unexpected reason.\r\n\r\n• Any claim due to road blocks, curfew, accident etc.\r\n\r\n• Any type of insurance – personal, medical, travel etc.\r\n\r\n• Any other services\' not specified in the Colum \"Inclusions\".\r\n\r\n• All kind of personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone bills and beverages, Camera Fees.\r\n\r\n• Cable Car Tickets, Air Fare, Any meals unless and otherwise specifically mentioned.\r\n\r\n• No refund on any unused transportation or any services in any circumstances.','','2022-05-27','2022-05-30',0,0,0,'2022-05-20 11:37:29','2022-05-20 11:37:29'),(80,292,349,2,0,0,46700,15000,'Amazing Dubai','No of Pax : 2\r\n\r\nCheck In : o1/06/2022\r\n\r\nCheck Out : 06/06/2022\r\n\r\nDestination Dubai','','\r\nReturn Airfare\r\n\r\nReturn airport transfers on Pvt\r\n\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\n\r\nDesert safari with BBQ dinner\r\n\r\nDhow cruise  creek with dinner\r\n\r\nDubai half day city tour\r\n\r\nBurj Khalifa 124 floor non prime time \r\n\r\nMiracle gar