ality : Indian','','Return Airfare\r\n\r\nAccommodation as above with Breakfast\r\n\r\nSealife Siam Ocean World (Aquarium Only) – PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nFull Day Safari World + Marine Park with Lunch  -  PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nHot spring, Emerald Pool and tiger cave temple (Exclude the National Park Admission Fee THB 400 PP) -SIC Transfer\r\n\r\nHalf Day Kayaking at Thalan - SIC Transfer\r\n\r\nBKK APT - BKK HTL - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nBKK HTL - BKK APT - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nKrabi APT - Krabi HTL - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nKrabi HTL - Krabi APT - PVT Transfer\r\n','Anything which is not included in inclusions.','','2023-01-05','2023-01-12',1,0,0,'2022-09-14 12:10:00','2022-09-14 12:21:38'),(164,479,38,4,2,0,134700,15000,'Thailand','No of Adults : 04\r\n\r\nChild : 02 (2,5)\r\n\r\nCheck in : 05/01/2023\r\n\r\nCheck out : 12/01/2023\r\n\r\nDestination : Thailand\r\n\r\nNationality : Indian','','Return Airfare\r\n\r\nAccommodation as above with Breakfast\r\n\r\nSealife Siam Ocean World (Aquarium Only) – PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nFull Day Safari World + Marine Park with Lunch  -  PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nHot spring, Emerald Pool and tiger cave temple (Exclude the National Park Admission Fee THB 400 PP) -SIC Transfer\r\n\r\nHalf Day Kayaking at Thalan - SIC Transfer\r\n\r\nBKK APT - BKK HTL - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nBKK HTL - BKK APT - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nKrabi APT - Krabi HTL - PVT Transfer\r\n\r\nKrabi HTL - Krabi APT - PVT Transfer\r\n','Anything which is not included in inclusions.','','2023-01-05','2023-01-12',1,0,0,'2022-09-17 17:50:03','2022-09-17 17:50:03'),(165,480,15518,2,0,0,113000,12000,'Amazing Kerala','Trip Duration: 7 Nights/ 8 Days\r\n\r\n3N Wayanad and 4N Munnar\r\n\r\nDay 01 – Calicut – Wayanadu - Pick up From Calicut and transfer to Wayanadu. Check in at resort. On the way visit Lakkidi View Point - it is the gateway of Wayanad as it is located at the crest of the serpentine Thamarassery ghat pass. There are nine hairpin curves. Evening proceed to visit Pookote Lake - Which is a natural fresh water lake nestling amid evergreen forests and mountain slopes at an altitude of 770 meters above sea level. Dinner and overnight stay at Wayanadu\r\n \r\nDay 02 – Wayanadu - After breakfast proceed for sightseeing to Kuruva Island these are small island located on tributeris of river kabani - Tholpetty Wildlife Sanctuary is one of the best places in Kerala for sighting wild elephants. Other than elephant herds, there is good chance to spot bison, deer, monkey, giant squirrel and a range of other animals.Tigers and leopards are present here. Thirunalli Temple Temple is the only temple in the world where the devotees can perform all the rituals related to one’s life, starting from birth to death and life after death. It is one of the most ancient temples in Kerala. It is believed that here the prathishta of Lord Vishnu was performed by Lord Brahma. It is also known as \'\'Sahyamala Kshetram\'\' and \'\'Kashi of the South\'\'.\r\n \r\nDay 03 – Wayanadu - After fresh up and breakfast proceed to visit Chembra Peak- is the highest peak in Wayanad, A heart shaped lake on the way to the top of the peak is a major tourist attraction, trucking is about 4 km. Next Moving to Soochippara Water falls which is a three-tiered waterfall surrounded by Deciduous, Evergreen and Montane forests. Locally referred to as Soochipara (\"Soochi\" meaning \"Needle\" and \"Para\" meaning \"Rock\"). Also visit Banasura Dam during your stay. Evening back to homestay dinner and overnight stay.\r\n \r\nDay 04 – Wayanadu - Munnar - After breakfast check out frpm the hotel and transfer to Munnar. Munnar is 1800 mts above sea level and also the place of South India\'s highest peak (Anamudi-2695 mts). On the way visit Valara, Cheeyappara waterfalls & Tea Plantations. On arrival at Munnar transfer to Hotel. Overnight stay at Munnar.\r\n \r\nDay 05 - Munnar\r\nAfter breakfast proceed to visit Rajamala (Eravikulam National Park - open as per the directions by the forest authorities ), the best place to see Nilgiri Tahr (Hermitragus Hilarious)- the mountain goat of South India & Tea Musium.  Evening have a short visit at Munnar town. You can see the beautiful tea estates like a green paradise. Overnight stay at Munnar\r\n \r\nDay - 06- Munnar\r\nAfter breakfast proceed for sightseeing. Maduppatty dam ,Echo Point, Kundalay Dam,Pothenmedu View Point, Blossom Park etc are some of the highlights of the sightseeing. Shopping & overnight stay at Munnar.\r\n \r\nDay - 07- Munnar\r\nRelax at the resort or proceed for local sightseeing. Dinner and overnight stay at Munnar.\r\n \r\nDay - 08- Munnar – Cochin \r\nAfter breakfast check out from the hotel and drop at Cochin Airport for departure.','','* Flights for Delhi-Calicut and Kochi-Delhi\r\n* Meal plans as indicated on the itinerary\r\n* Accommodation on Twin Sharing Basis\r\n* All Transfers and sight seeing By Ac Toyota Etios/Swift Dzire Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 \r\n  AM to 7.00 PM\r\n* All Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\n','Anything that is not mentioned in Inclusions','','2022-12-13','2022-12-20',1,0,0,'2022-09-18 16:49:16','2022-09-18 16:49:16'),(166,481,349,6,3,0,964120,136000,'Mesmerizing Dubai','3N Abu Dhabhi and 6N/9N Dubai\r\n\r\n','','\r\n* Accommodation\r\n* Daily breakfast\r\n* Two  way Airport transfer\r\n* Inter Hotel transfer\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner\r\n* Dhow cruise dinner\r\n* City tour\r\n* Abu Dhabi Ferrari world ticket and transfer\r\n* Burj Khalifa 124th floor ticket and transfer NPT\r\n* Future of museum ticket and transfer\r\n* Ain Dubai ticket and transfer\r\n* Global Village\r\n* Miracle Garden\r\n* Aqua venture and lost chamber\r\n* Bollywood theme park\r\n* Dolphin show ticket and transfer\r\n* Vat\r\n* All tour and transfer on pvt basis','Anything that is not included in Inclusions','','2022-12-25','2023-01-03',0,0,0,'2022-09-19 18:15:54','2022-09-19 20:33:40'),(167,482,628,4,2,0,42000,5000,'Chandigarh-Amritsar-Delhi','2N Chandigarh - 2N Amritsar - 2N Patiala\r\n\r\nChandigarh – Amritsar – Patiala Itinerary\r\n\r\nDay1: Pick up from Airport and drop at hotel\r\nAfter check-in, visit to Sector 17 Market. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay2: Chandigarh Local\r\nPost breakfast, visit to Rose Garden, Rock Garden, Sukhna Lake. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay3: Chandigarh – Amritsar\r\nPost breakfast, depart for Amritsar. After reaching Amritsar, check-in at the hotel. And visit to local market, Golden Temple, and Jallianwala Bagh. Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay4: Wagah Border\r\nAfter breakfast, Visit the Wagah border and then Gobindgarh Fort/ Saada Pind. Overnight stay at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay5: Amritsar - Patiala\r\nAfter breakfast, check out from the hotel and leave for Patiala. After reaching check-in at the hotel. Then visit to Gurudwara Dukhniwaran Sahib and Adalat Bazar. Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay6: Patiala - Ludhiana - Patiala\r\nAfter breakfast, visit to Ludhiana. Overnight stay at hotel in Patiala.\r\n\r\nDay7: Patiala - Delhi\r\nAfter breakfast, check out from the hotel and depart for Delhi with beautiful memories. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNote:\r\n* Places to visit in Ludhiana (Gurudwara Nanaksar Jagraon, Rakh Bagh Park, Maharaja Ranjit Singh War Meuseum). The guest can visit any of them as per time availability. \r\n* The vehicle will remain with the client all the time. \r\n\r\n','','* Pick-up from Chandigarh Airport\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* 2 Nights accommodation in Chandigarh\r\n* 2 Nights accommodation in Amritsar\r\n* 2 Nights accommodation in Patiala\r\n* All sightseeing and transfers by an AC vehicle (Ertiga/Innova whichever will be available)\r\n* Transfer from Patiala to Delhi\r\n* All taxes for mentioned accommodation and meal plan\r\n* Toll Taxes','* Parking charges\r\n* Anything else that is not mentioned in Inclusions','The rates are valid till 28th Sept','2022-10-17','2022-10-23',0,0,0,'2022-09-20 17:01:43','2022-09-27 22:39:29'),(168,483,349,6,3,0,558600,90000,'Mesmer