hing which is not mentioned in the inclusions.','The rates are valid till 20th Feb, 2023. Airfare is dynamic','2023-05-07','2023-05-12',1,0,0,'2023-02-17 17:06:50','2023-02-17 17:06:50'),(232,607,419,4,0,0,0,0,'Delhi-Srinagar','1N Srinagar - 2N Sonmarg - 1N Gulmarg - 1N Pahalgam - 1N Srinagar\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 1 - ARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING (CHECK-IN HOTEL)\r\n \r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n \r\n \r\nDay 2 & 3 - CHECK-IN AT SONMARG (2 NIGHTS STAY)\r\n \r\nDay 2- After breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Sonmarg hotel, (Meadows of Gold), it has sheer scenic splendour. The very way-a metalled road snakes through massive mountains laden with forests and firs. After a breath-taking journey from Srinagar you come across River Sindh that is abounded with trout & Mahseer. Onwards the valley opens up to a meadow. After check-in Day at leisure. Overnight stay at hotel in Sonmarg.\r\n \r\nDay 3- After breakfast Ponies can be hired for a trip up to Thajiwas glacier ; a major attraction during the summer months. Sonamarg\'s importance lies in the fact that it is the last halt on the Kashmir side for the drive from Srinagar to Leh. You will be fascinated to see Snowy Mountains against a cerulean sky against its backdrop. Overnight stay at hotel in Sonmarg.\r\n \r\nDay 4 - CHECK-IN AT GULMARG (1 NIGHT STAY)\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as “Meadow Of Flowers “ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg.\r\n \r\n \r\nDa 5 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (1 NIGHT STAY)\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS “ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.\r\n \r\n \r\nDay 6 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.\r\n \r\n \r\nDay  7 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.','','✔ Delhi-Srinagar-Delhi Economy Class Airfare\r\n✔ Accommodation as above.\r\n✔ Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\n✔ Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis.\r\n✔ Sightseeing by a non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\n✔ Shikara Ride (01 hour)\r\n✔ Driver Allowances.\r\n✔ Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry fee at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n✔ Hotel Taxes\r\n ','✔ Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride, etc.\r\n✔ Extra Meals - Meals not included in the package anything not specifically mentioned under the head “Prices included”.\r\n✔ Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n✔ Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances.\r\n✔ Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n✔Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n✔ Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, minibars, etc.\r\n✔ Any expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc.\r\n✔ The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow.','The rates are valid till 28th Feb, 2023.','2023-04-19','2023-04-25',1,0,0,'2023-02-21 15:31:29','2023-02-21 15:31:29'),(233,609,349,3,0,0,51100,12000,'Dubai Adventure','4N Stay, Sightseeing, Meal and Transfers in Dubai\r\n\r\n','','* Delhi-Dubai-Delhi Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Return airport transfers on pvt \r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner on sic \r\n* Dubai half day city tour on sic \r\n* Dhow Cruise Marina With Dinner on sic \r\n* Burj kjhalifa 124 floor normal time on sic \r\n* Miracle garden + Global Village Combo on sic\r\n* 4Night stay in above mentioned hotel on breakfast basis\r\n* Visa\r\n* Insurance','* Any meal other than mentioned above\r\n* Private guide charges\r\n* Any service other than mentioned in Inclusions\r\n* TCS','The rates are valid till 27th Feb, 2023 and flight fare is dynamic. ','2023-02-28','2023-03-03',1,0,0,'2023-02-25 17:30:45','2023-02-25 17:31:34'),(234,612,16260,4,0,0,0,0,'Mystical Europe','4N London - 3N Paris','','* Chicago - London and Paris - Chicago economy class airfare\r\n* London airport to hotel on pvt basis\r\n* London hotel to airport on pvt basis\r\n* Paris airport to hotel on pvt basis\r\n* Paris hotel to airport  on pvt basis\r\n* Train from London to Paris in 2nd class\r\n* City Sightseeing London Hop-on Hop-off Bus To