3:  Bentota to colombo  \r\nBreakfast at the hotel & transfer to Colombo, Gangarama temple , Colombo museum\r\nProceed to Colombo City Tour & Shopping \r\nCheck-in & Leisure at the hotel\r\nOvernight stay at hotel- Colombo\r\n\r\nCity Tour: While on your city tour in Colombo you may visit famous places including Galle Face Green, the Viharamahadevi Park, National Museum, Twin World Trade Center towers, Old Parliament Building, Fort district, Independence Hall at Independence Square, and prominent Buddhist, Hindu, Islam and Christian places of worship. (Entrance fees to sites not included). For shopping, you may visit Odel, House of Fashion, Beverly Street, Majestic City, Noritake, etc         \r\n\r\nDay 04:  Colombo   -Airport for Departure\r\nØ  After breakfast at the hotel & proceed to Airport for departure','','* Delhi-Colombo, Colombo-Male, and Male-Delhi Economy Class airfare\r\n* Accommodation and meals at the hotels mentioned or similar.\r\n* Transportation in a Pvt air-conditioned vehicle as mentioned above\r\n* English-speaking chauffeur\r\n* Government Tax (VAT 15%).\r\n* Toll charges.\r\n* Travel Insurance only for Sri Lanka','TOUR GUIDE & Guide Fees\r\nENTRANCE FEE\r\nLunch\r\nArrival and Departure PCR test\r\nTips to Chauffeurs / \r\nOptional Excursions\r\nSIM Cards\r\nAny fluctuations in the dollar component will affect the costing.\r\nSite visit (Entrance Fee)\r\nExtra meal not mentioned on the above program during the tour.\r\nEarly check in or late checkout charges.\r\nCamera or Video permits.\r\nExpenses of a personal nature.\r\nAny service not specifically mentioned in the inclusion.\r\nAny increase of cost due to political disturbance / band or increase in tax or fuel cost, leading to increase in surface transportation  and land arrangements, which may come into effect  prior to departure or while touring ','The rates are valid till 20th March, 2023. Airfare is dynamic. ','2023-06-08','2023-06-11',1,0,0,'2023-03-13 21:57:08','2023-03-13 21:57:08'),(240,621,6,3,0,0,14000,6000,'Golden Triangle','1N Jaipur - 1N Agra - 1N Delhi\r\n\r\nDay 1: Delhi-Jaipur\r\nOn Arrival, pick-up from the airport and drive to Jaipur. Check-in at the hotel and Explore historical places like Amer Fort, Hawa Mahal, Jal Mahal and Jantar-Mantar. Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2: Jaipur-Agra\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive to Agra. Check-in at the hotel and visit Taj Mahal, Red Fort and Fatehpur Sikri. Overnight stay at the hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3: Agra-Delhi\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive back to Delhi. Check-in at the hotel. As per time availability, choose any 2 or 3 places to visit out of Red Fort, Jama Masjid, Connaught Place, and Humayun Tomb followed by shopping at Janpath and Palika Bazaar.\r\n\r\nDay 4: After breakfast, check-out from the hotel and drive to airport. Trip ends here with beautiful memories. ','','* Hotel accommodation at Delhi, Jaipur and Agra.\r\n* Daily breakfast\r\n* Sedan Car (Swift Dezire) for all transfers and sightseeing. \r\n* Parking and Toll Charges\r\n','* Guide Charges\r\n* Any other meal other than mentioned above.\r\n* Any type of personal expenses. \r\n* Anything that is not mentioned in the Inclusions. ','The rates are valid till 20th March, 2023\r\nCar can be upgraded to Innova/Ertiga for Rs. 10500.','2023-04-21','2023-04-24',0,0,0,'2023-03-15 18:11:05','2023-03-15 21:59:48'),(241,624,15540,5,2,0,0,0,'Mauritius Diaries','6Night Stay in Mauritius\r\n\r\n','','Delhi-Mauritius-Delhi Economy Class Airfare\r\n6 Night accommodation in the mentioned hotel\r\nDaily Breakfast and Dinner\r\nReturn Airport Transfers\r\nFull Day North Island Tour\r\nFull Day South Island Tour\r\nFull Day Ile Aux Cerf. Tour\r\nTravel Insurance\r\n','Any type of personal expense\r\nAny meal other than the mentioned above\r\nGuide Charges\r\nVisa Charges\r\nTCS','The rates are valid till 25th March, 2023. The flight fare is dynamic. \r\n','2023-06-14','2023-06-20',1,0,0,'2023