thi Sightseeing Day 02\r\nMorning after breakfast local sightseeing of temples in Tirupati including Sri Govindarajaswami Temple, Kapila Theertham, Padmavati Temple, Trimala (Tirupati Balaji) Temple Akash Ganga & Paap Vinashni Temple. Overnight at the Resort/hotel.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Ramee Guestline Hotel (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 3(29 Apr 2023 - Saturday): Chennai Departure\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Ramee Guestline Hotel\r\n\r\nDeparture Transfer - Chennai Departure\r\nMorning after breakfast check out the Hotel and drive towards the Chennai international Airport/Railway station for your onward journey. Tour ends with happy memories.','','Delhi-Tirupati-Delhi Airfare\r\nMeal plans as indicated on the itinerary\r\nAccommodation on Twin Sharing Basis\r\nAll Inclusion and sightseeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\nAll Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\nAbove Rate is Inclusive of GST 5%','All those which are not mentioned above\r\nEntry Fees To Monuments And Palaces\r\nPorterage At Hotels And Airports, Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Liquors, Wine, Etc\r\nAll Items Of Personal Nature\r\nAny Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc\r\nAny Increase In Taxes Or Fuel Leading To An Increase In Surface Transport\r\nAyurveda Charges','The rates are valid till 30th March, 2023. Airfare is dynamic.','2023-04-27','2023-04-29',1,0,0,'2023-03-28 18:59:39','2023-03-28 18:59:39'),(253,638,1616,2,0,0,0,0,'Tirupati Balaji','Day 1(27 Apr 2023 - Thursday): Arrival Chennai - Tirupathi\r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival Transfer - Arrival Chennai - Tirupathi\r\nOn arrival at the Chennai airport/railway station, meet our representative who will be there for your warm welcome and afterwards to transfer you to Tirupati. Tirupati is a city in the Indian state of Andhra Pradesh. Its Sri Venkateswara Temple sits atop one of the the 7 peaks of Tirumala Hills, attracting scores of Hindu pilgrims. Sri Venkateswara National Park, home to the temple, also contains the Sri Venkateswara Zoological Park with lions and primates. Nearby, next to a waterfall and cave believed to be sacred, Sri Kapileswara Swamy Temple is dedicated to Lord Shiva. Check in at the hotel and the rest of the day is free at leisure. During your free time, you can walk out to explore the surroundings, interact with locals, visit local markets or stay back in hotel to take pleasure of its modern amenities. Overnight stay at resort/hotel.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Ramee Guestline Hotel (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 2(28 Apr 2023 - Friday): Tirupati to Tirupathi Sightseeing Day 02\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Ramee Guestline Hotel\r\n\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Tirupati to Tirupathi Sightseeing Day 02\r\nMorning after breakfast local sightseeing of temples in Tirupati including Sri Govindarajaswami Temple, Kapila Theertham, Padmavati Temple, Trimala (Tirupati Balaji) Temple Akash Ganga & Paap Vinashni Temple. Overnight at the Resort/hotel.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Ramee Guestline Hotel (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 3(29 Apr 2023 - Saturday): Chennai Departure\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Ramee Guestline Hotel\r\n\r\nDeparture Transfer - Chennai Departure\r\nMorning after breakfast check out the Hotel and drive towards the Chennai international Airport/Railway station for your onward journey. Tour ends with happy memories.','','Delhi-Tirupati-Delhi Airfare\r\nMeal plans as indicated on the itinerary\r\nAccommodation on Twin Sharing Basis\r\nAll Inclusion and sightseeing By Ac Vehicle as per the itinerary from 8.00 AM to 7.00 PM\r\nAll Toll, Parking, Driver Bata & Fuel Cost\r\nAbove Rate is Inclusive of GST 5%','All those which are not mentioned above\r\nEntry Fees To Monuments And Palaces\r\nPorterage At Hotels And Airports, Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Liquors, Wine, Etc\r\nAll Items Of Personal Nature\r\nAny Cost Arising Due To Natural Calamities Like Landslides, Roadblocks, Etc\r\nAny Increase In Taxes Or Fuel Leading To An Increase In Surface Transport\r\nAyurveda Charges','The rates are valid till 30th March, 2023. Airfare is dynamic.','2023-04-27','2023-04-29',1,0,0,'2023-03-28 20:28:58','2023-03-28 20:28:58'),(254,639,16260,4,1,0,0,0,'Mystical Europe','Great Britain, France & Switzerland \r\nFrom – To- London – Paris – Interlaken – Lucerne\r\n\r\n\r\nItinerary :\r\nDay 1 : London: On arrival in London transfer to your hotel. Evening is free at leisure to explore the city on your own. Overnight in London.\r\nDay 2 : London: Today morning you will Proceed for Hop on Hop off tour of London. Have an unforgettable tour of London on the hop-on hop-off bus through the heart of the city. View iconic structures as Buckingham Palace, Tower of London, St Paul’s Cathedral, Tower Bridge and many more. See celebrated areas of London including Trafalgar Square and Piccadilly. Later, is free at leisure or we suggest you to visit the Mcarthurglen Designer Outlet which can be reached by the high-speed link from London St. Pancras (ticket not included) in around 40 minutes. Overnight in London.\r\nDay 3 : London- Day Free\r\nDay 4 : London – Paris: Proceed to St-Pancras Station (on your own) and enjoy the Eurostar Journey to reach Paris. On arrival, transfer to the hotel on your own. In the evening proceed on an optional Moulin Rouge Show (at an additional cost). Overnight in Paris.\r\nDay 5 : Paris: Proceed for Paris Seinorama Tour (4 hrs) including City tour of Paris, Seine Cruise & Eiffel Tower – 2nd level visit. Overnight in Paris.\r\nDay 6 : Paris – Basel – Interlaken: Today proceed to Gare De l’est Railway Station (on your own) and board your TGV train from Paris to Basel (a journey of around 4 hours approx) and change from Basel to board train to Interlaken. Arrive in Interlaken. In the afternoon after check in, proceed for your Schilthorn Piz Gloria tour. Overnight in Interlaken.\r\nNote: “Maintenance Schilthorn Cableway: 24.04. – 28.04.2023 / 13.11. – 08.12.2023”\r\nDay 7 : Interlaken: Excursion to Jungfraujoch – Top of Switzerland by mountain railway. Overnight in Interlaken.\r\nDay 8 : Interlaken – Lucerne: Travel to Lucerne by Lucerne – Interlaken Express Train. Later, procced for your Panorama-Yacht Saphir- 1 hour sightseeing cruise. Overnight in Lucerne.\r\nDay 9: Lucerne : Excursion to Mt. Titlis incl ice-flyer chairlift or Mt. Pilatus. Overnight in Lucerne.\r\nDay 10 : Lucerne – Zurich : Travel to Zurich airport for your flight to final destination','','– 09 Nights accommodation\r\n– Daily Breakfast\r\n– Arrival airport transfer in London (LHR) on a Private basis\r\n– Swiss Travel Pass (06 Days Consecutive – 02nd Class)\r\n– Eurostar & TGV Tickets (02nd class)\r\n– Sightseeing Tours','- Airfare\r\n- Any meal other than that mentioned above\r\n- Any type of personal expense\r\n','- Rates & Availability Is Subject To Change At The Time Of Booking.\r\n- Above Mentioned Excursions Are Unescorted.\r\n- Rate Is Subject To Change If There Are Changes On Number Of Pax, Number Of Nights Or Change Of Travelling Date.\r\n- No Booking Has Been Made Yet','2023-07-21','2023-07-30',0,0,0,'2023-03-29 18:07:29','2023-03-29 18:07:29'),(255,640,16260,4,1,0,716200,120000,'Mystical Europe','Duration: 10 Nights & 11 Days\r\nCountries: France, Switzerland, Italy, Vatican\r\n\r\nDay 1\r\nArrive into Paris – the City of Romance, Lights and Glamour. \r\nOvernight in Paris. (Dinner)\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 2 \r\nGuided city tour of Paris. Visit to Eiffel tower 3rd (Top) Level. Take a funicular ride at Montmartre to see the Sacre-Coeur Basillica, the second most visited monument in Paris. Enjoy a romantic cruise on River Seine.\r\n\r\nDay 3\r\nEnjoy your fun filled day at Disneyland® Paris (choice of Disney® Parks or Walt Disney Studios® Park). \r\nOvernight in Paris. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 4 \r\nDrive to Geneva. Orientation tour of Geneva. \r\nOvernight at the hotel in Lausanne. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 5 \r\nVisit Olympic Museum. Visit Mt. Titlis- enjoy Cable car rides including the world’s first rotating cable car, the Rotair – to the top of Mt. Titlis at 3,020 metres. Drive to Zurich.\r\nOvernight at the hotel in Zurich. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 6 \r\nHighlight of the tour, A magical alpine excursion to the top of Europe - the amazing Jungfraujoch and scenic Interlaken.\r\nOvernight in Zurich. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 7 \r\nOrientation tour of Lucerne. Cruise on Lake of Lucerne. Free time for shopping.\r\nOvernight in Lugano. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner) \r\n\r\nDay 8\r\nWelcome to Venice - the floating city of Italy. Enjoy Gondola ride.\r\nOvernight in Padova/Bologna. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 9\r\nGuided walking city tour of Florence. View the remarkable and famous Leaning Tower of Pisa.\r\nOvernight in Tuscany region. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 10 \r\nAll roads lead to Rome – the eternal city. Visit the world’s smallest country – the Vatican City. (which includes Vatican Museum, Sisitne Chapel & St. Peter’s Basilica)\r\nOvernight in Rome. (Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner)\r\n\r\nDay 11\r\nFly back home\r\n(Breakfast)\r\n\r\n','','* 10 Nights accommodation in top 4 star hotels\r\n* Driver tips\r\n* Return Airport transfers\r\n* Sightseeing\r\nFRANCE\r\nParis\r\n•	City tour with a local guide\r\n•	Visit to the 3rd level of the Eiffel Tower\r\n•	Full day excitement and thrill at Disneyland® Paris\r\n•	Funicular ride to see the Sacre Coeur Basilica- Montmartre.\r\n•	Enjoy romantic cruise on River Seine\r\n\r\nSWITZERLAND\r\nGeneva:\r\n•	Orientation tour of Geneva\r\nLausanne:\r\n•	Entrance to Olympic Museum\r\nLucerne:\r\n•	Orientation tour of Lucerne\r\n•	Mt Titlis \r\n•	Lake Lucerne Cruise \r\n•	Free time for shopping\r\nInterlaken:\r\n•	Cog wheel train ride to Jungfraujoch - Top of Europe\r\n•	Visit scenic Interlaken\r\n\r\nITALY\r\nVenice:\r\n•	St. Mark’s square by Private boat\r\n•	Enjoy a classic Venetian Gondola ride\r\n•	Visit the famous Murano Glass showroom\r\nFlorence:\r\n•	Guided walking city tour with a local English-speaking guide\r\nPisa\r\n•	Visit Square of Miracles\r\n•	Photo-stop at the Leaning Tower\r\nRome:\r\n•	Guided City tour with a local English speaking guide\r\n•	Visit to Trevi Fountain\r\n\r\nVATICAN CITY\r\nVatican City\r\n•	Visit the Vatican Museum – see sculptures and masterpieces of Renaissance art\r\n•	Visit to the awe-inspiring Sistine Chapel\r\n•	Visit the magnificent St. Peter’s Basilica\r\n\r\nMeals\r\n•	Daily Continental Buffet Breakfast.\r\n•	9 Indian Jain/Vegetarian/Non-Vegetarian Lunches.\r\n•	10 Indian Jain/Vegetarian/Non-Vegetarian Dinners.\r\n•	Daily Mineral Water Bottle (500ml) \r\n(Packed lunch will be served on the day you visit Disneyland Paris)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','•	The cost of the Airfare, Passport, POE charges, Visa charges, Overseas Travel Insurance, etc.\r\n•	Any expenses of personal nature such as Porterage, Laundry, and Alcohol, Food or Drink not in the regular menus provided by us, mini bar and telephone calls\r\n•	Any extra meals not included in the itinerary. Meals are pre - set and a choice of menu is not available\r\n•	Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in ‘Inclusions’\r\n•	GST, TCS, and other taxes as applicable\r\n•	Anything which is not specified in the Itinerary\r\n\r\n','- Rates & Availability Is Subject To Change At The Time Of Booking.\r\n- Rate Is Subject To Change If There Are Changes On the Number Of Pax, Number Of Nights, Or Change Of Travelling Date.\r\n- No Booking Has Been Made Yet\r\n- Instruction for Arrival & Departure Coach Transfers\r\n* Paris (CDG Airport) Arrival Transfer – Flight landing time should be between 08 AM – 02 PM.\r\n* Rome (FCO Airport) Departure Transfer: Flight departure timing should be post-02 PM.','2023-07-15','2023-07-25',0,0,0,'2023-03-30 14:01:00','2023-03-30 19:02:35'),(256,641,1616,2,0,0,0,0,'Tirupati Balaji','Day 1(27 Apr 2023 - Thursday): Arrival Chennai - Tirupathi\r\nMeet & Assist on arrival\r\nArrival Transfer - Arrival Tirupati\r\nOn arrival at the Tirupati airport/railway station, meet our representative who will be there for your warm welcome and afterwards to transfer you to Tirupati. Tirupati is a city in the Indian state of Andhra Pradesh. Its Sri Venkateswara Temple sits atop one of the the 7 peaks of Tirumala Hills, attracting scores of Hindu pilgrims. Sri Venkateswara National Park, home to the temple, also contains the Sri Venkateswara Zoological Park with lions and primates. Nearby, next to a waterfall and cave believed to be sacred, Sri Kapileswara Swamy Temple is dedicated to Lord Shiva. Check in at the hotel and the rest of the day is free at leisure. During your free time, you can walk out to explore the surroundings, interact with locals, visit local markets or stay back in hotel to take pleasure of its modern amenities. Overnight stay at resort/hotel.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Ramee Guestline Hotel (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 2(28 Apr 2023 - Friday): Tirupati to Tirupathi Sightseeing Day 02\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Ramee Guestline Hotel\r\n\r\nSightseeing Day 02 - Tirupati to Tirupathi Sightseeing Day 02\r\nMorning after breakfast local sightseeing of temples in Tirupati including Sri Govindarajaswami Temple, Kapila Theertham, Padmavati Temple, Trimala (Tirupati Balaji) Temple Akash Ganga & Paap Vinashni Temple. Overnight at the Resort/hotel.\r\nOvernight Stay at Hotel Ramee Guestline Hotel (Option 1) (Meal Plan - MAPAI)\r\n\r\nDay 3(29 Apr 2023 - Saturday): Chennai Departure\r\nBreakfast at the Hotel - Ramee Guestline Hotel\r\n\r\nDeparture Transfer - Tirupati Departure\r\nMorning after breakfast check out the Hotel and drive towards the Tirupati Airport/Railway station for your onward journey. Tour ends with happy memories.','','Delhi-Tirupati-Delhi Airfare\r\nMeal plans as indicated on the itinerary\r\nAccommodation on T