lives in the Kargil war. Return to leh in the afternoon. \r\nGurdwara Pathar sahib located at a distance of 40 kms from leh, was constructed in 1571, in memory of guru nanak to commemorate his visit to this region. \r\nMagnetic hill is the place where you will see your car, with its engine turned off, move upwards on a steep slope. It almost sounds unbelievable. \r\nThe sangam is the place called nimu where the zanskar river and indus rivers merge. In the evening come back to leh. Overnight hotel.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 03: Leh to Nubra Valley (128 Kms | 4-5 hrs approx)\r\nAfter breakfast, drive to Nubra Valley, also known as Valley of flowers via Khardungla, the highest motorable road in the World, (18,380 ft). On your arrival in Nubra Valley check in the hotel / camp After a sumptuous lunch take a walk on the banks of Shayok river, you can also enjoy a ride on double humped camels on the Sand Dunes between Deskit & Hundur Village, by yourself. O/N Nubra Valley\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 04: Nubra – Turtuk | Tyakshi – Nubra (170 Kms |5-6 hrs approx.)\r\nAfter breakfast, I drove to Turtuk (the first time it opened for tourists since 2010) . This village was captured by the Indian Army in 1971 from Pakistan, en route to visit Tyakshi (it is the border that divides India and Pakistan) O/N Nubra Valley.\r\n\r\nDay 05: Nubra - Pangong Lake via Shyok River road (150 Kms | 6-7 Hrs approx)\r\nAfter Breakfast leave for Pangong Lake 14,500 ft, drive of 6 – 7 Hrs. Arrival at Camp, Later free time at Leisure and enjoy the color changing lake and the sun set on the banks of lake. O/N Pangong Lake\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 06: Pangong Lake – Leh (140 Kms | 4-5 hrs approx)\r\nEarly morning enjoy the picturesque view of the Sun rise on the lake. After Breakfast drive back to Leh, en route visit Thiksey Monastery and Shey Palace on additional Cost if guests are interested, Day Free for Leisure Evening by walk visit Leh Market for Shopping (Own Cost). O/N Leh\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 07: Leh Departure\r\nEarly morning transfer to the airport for taking the flight back home. Tour ends.','','Delhi-Leh-Delhi Economy Class Airfare\r\nTraditional welcome in the hotel with welcome drink (hot tea | coffee | kahwa) on arrival\r\nAccommodation in well-appointed guest selected rooms & camps.\r\nDaily buffet/TDH breakfast & dinner\r\nAll Transfer & Sightseeing tours (Point to Point) by Non-Ac  Tempo Traveler in all Categories as per the itinerary.\r\nMorning Tea / Coffee with Biscuits on the day of departure\r\nInner line Permit wildLife & Red Cross fee.','Any expenses of personal nature such as tips, laundry, telephone calls, fax etc.\r\nEntrance Fees for Monument, Monasteries & Museums\r\nAny kind of drinks (Alcoholic, Mineral, Aerated)\r\nRafting charges, Camel Safari Charges, Guide charges, if any.\r\nAny expense incurred or loss caused by reasons beyond our control such as bad weather, natural calamities (landslides, floods), flight delays / rescheduling / cancellations, any accidents / medical evacuations, riots/strikes/war, & etc.\r\nAnything not specifically mentioned under the head “Inclusions”\r\nAny expenses incurred on extra transport, apart from the ones covered in the package\r\n','The rates are valid till 22nd April, 2023. The flight fare is dynamic. \r\nThe rooms are subject to availability. ','2023-06-18','2023-06-24',1,0,0,'2023-04-18 22:08:29','2023-04-18 22:08:29'),(272,670,15526,6,1,0,0,0,'Kashmir - the heaven on earth','Day 1 - ARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING (CHECK-IN HOTEL)\r\n\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDay 2 - DOODHPATHRI DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and  proceed to Doodhpathri - valley of milk, located in Budgam district, lies in bowl shaped valley in Pir Panjal Range. Its an alpine valley covered with snow clad mountains. Not a lot of tourists come to this place, since the road conditions are not favorable. After some quiet and peaceful time at Doodhpathri drive back for overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\n \r\nDay 3 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (1 NIGHT STAY)\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS “ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.\r\n\r\n \r\nDay 4 - CHECK-IN AT GULMARG (1 NIGHT STAY)\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as “Meadow Of Flowers “ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.\r\n\r\n \r\nDay 6 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.','','✔ Delhi-Srinagar-Delhi Economy class airfare\r\n\r\n✔ Accommodation  as above.\r\n\r\n✔ Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\n\r\n✔ Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis. \r\n\r\n✔ Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\n\r\n✔ Shikara Ride (01 hour).\r\n\r\n✔ Driver Allowances.\r\n\r\n✔ Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n\r\n✔ Hotel Taxes','✔ Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n\r\n✔ Extra Meals - Meals not included in package anything not specifically mentioned under the head “Prices included”. \r\n\r\n✔ Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n\r\n✔ Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances. \r\n\r\n✔ Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n\r\n✔Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n\r\n✔ Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc. \r\n\r\n✔ Any expense incurred by unforeseen/natural circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown, strikes, etc. \r\n\r\n✔ The cost of chained vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg & Gulmarg to Tangmarg or Sonamarg in case of heavy snow.','The rates are valid till 22nd April, 2023. The flight fare is dynamic. Hotel rooms are subject to availability.','2023-06-18','2023-06-24',1,0,0,'2023-04-19 23:50:05','2023-04-19 23:50:05'),(274,671,2690,5,0,0,0,0,'Phuket and Singapore Diaries','3N Phuket - 3N Phuket Stay in 5 star Hotel with daily breakfast\r\n\r\n3N Singapore - 3N Singapore Stay in 4 star Hotel with daily breakfast','','Phuket Part –\r\n* 03 Nights Stay Phuket\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Half Day City tour of Phuket – SIC\r\n* Phi Phi Island by Speed Boat with Lunch – SIC (Exclude National Marine Park Fee THB 400 PP)\r\n* Phuket Airport to Phuket Hotel – PVT\r\n* Phuket Hotel to Phuket Airport – PVT\r\n* All sightseeings and transfers on Pvt/SIC as mentioned above\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Visa Charges\r\n\r\nSingapore Part –\r\n* 03 Nights Stay Singapore\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Return Airport Transfers – PVT\r\n* Night Safari – SIC\r\n* Universal Studio + SEA Aquarium – SIC\r\n* ONE DAY BATAM CITY & SHOPPING TOUR with Lunch (Note: Minimum 3 pax required to operate the tour).\r\n* All sightseeings and transfers on Pvt/SIC as mentioned above\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Visa Charges','* Any meal other than that mentioned above\r\n* Any type of personal expense like laundary, grooming, souvenir, etc.\r\n* TCS','The rates are valid till 23th April, 2023. The air fare is dynamic','2023-05-10','2023-05-16',1,0,0,'2023-04-20 17:35:01','2023-04-20 17:50:20'),(276,672,54,3,1,0,0,0,'Singapore Diaries','4N Singapore Stay in 4 star hotel with daily breakfast\r\n\r\nSuggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\n1st Day (31 May)\r\n* Singapore - Airport Arrival Transfer (1 PRIVATE COMBI)\r\n* Night Safari Transfer (Return Transfers) - SIC 3 Adults + 01 Child\r\n* Night Safari Ticket Only (3 Adults + 01 Child)\r\n\r\n2nd Day (1 Jun)\r\n* Half Day City Orientation Drive - SIC 3 Adults + 01 Child\r\n* Gardens By The Bay (Return Transfers) - SIC 3 Adults + 01 Child\r\n* Gardens By The Bay Ticket (Cloud Forest + Flower Dome Ticket Only) 3 Adults + 01 Child\r\n\r\n3rd Day (2 Jun)\r\n* Universal Studios Transfer (Return Transfers) - SIC 3 Adults + 01 Child\r\n* Universal Studios Ticket Only (3 Adults + 01 Child)\r\n\r\n4th Day (3 Jun)\r\n* Full Day Sentosa Return Transfers- SIC 3 Adults + 01 Child\r\n* Sentosa Attractions Ticket (Combo 4 - Cable Car + Sea Aquarium + WOT) 3 Adults + 01 Child\r\n\r\n5th Day (4 Jun)\r\n* Singapore - Airport Departure Transfer (1 PRIVATE COMBI)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','* 4 Nights stay in 4 Star hote