t to change','2023-10-24','2023-10-29',1,0,0,'2023-05-30 13:35:21','2023-05-30 13:37:50'),(324,731,54,2,0,0,88800,36000,'Singapore and Kuala Lumpur  Diaries','3N Singapore 3N Kuala Lumpur','','DEL-SIN, SIN-KUL and KUL-DEL economy class airfare\r\n07 nights accommodation at hotel                                                                                                                                            \r\nDaily Breakfast                                                                                                                                    \r\nNight Safari with Tram ride                                                                                                                                           \r\nSingapore City Orientation Drive\r\nUniversal Studio Tour                                                                                                                                  \r\nSentosa Island (01 way cable car + Madame Tussauds 5 in 1 Combo + WOT 1st Show)                                                                                                                                             \r\nGardens By The Bay ( Flower Dome + Cloud forest with Avatar experience)\r\nHalf Day Kulalumpur City Tour + KL Tower ticket                                                                                                                                  \r\nGenting Full Day Tour Enroute Batu Caves + Two Ways Cable Car                                                                                                                                 \r\nKuala Lumpur Return airport transfers on seat-in-coach basis                                                                                                                                                                 \r\nReturn airport transfers (SIC in Kuala Lumpur)                                                                                                                                  \r\nAll Tours and transfers on seat-in-coach basis    \r\nVisa Charges\r\nTravel Insurance \r\n','* Any meal other than that mentioned above\r\n* Expenditure of a personal nature such as drinks, souvenirs and laundry\r\n* Anything which is not mentioned in the inclusions\r\n* TCS','The airfare is dynamic. This quote doesn\'t mean any confirmation for the booking. ','2023-06-23','2023-06-30',1,0,0,'2023-05-30 16:51:45','2023-05-31 19:54:38'),(325,737,54,4,0,0,460000,52000,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 00 – Flight from Delhi, report 03 hrs prior to departure.\r\n\r\nDay 01 -Arrive - Singapore\r\nSingapore - a sunny, tropical island in Southeast Asia, off the southern tip of the Malay Peninsula. Singapore, officially the Republic of Singapore, is known as the Lion City (Singapura) .On arrival pick up from airport and transfer to hotel.\r\n(Standard check in time is 1400 to 1500 Hrs).\r\nIn Evening pick up from hotel lobby and proceed to Night Safari - the world\'s first nocturnal zoo and is one of the most popular tourist attractions in Singapore. The Night Safari currently houses over 900 animals representing over 100 species, of which 41% are threatened species.\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 02 - Singapore – Day free\r\nBreakfast at hotel.\r\nDay at leisure to explore city on your own.\r\nPick up from Hotel lobby and proceed to Universal Studios- Singapore is Southeast\r\nAsia\'s first and only movie theme park, features thrilling attractions, rides and entertainment for everyone.\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 03- Singapore- City tour- Cruise\r\nBreakfast at hotel.\r\nAfter breakfast at Hotel, pick up from hotel lobby and proceed for Singapore city tour- visit Central district Orchard road,\r\nvisit at Chinese temple in China town, Merlion park at marina bay (photo stop only).\r\nAround 4pm , pick up from hotel and transfer to Cruise terminal.\r\nCruise sailing starts at 8 pm.\r\nOnBoard Cruise\r\n\r\nDay 04 - Cruise\r\nOnBoard Cruise/ High Seas\r\n\r\nDay 05- Singapore\r\nCruise arrives back to Singapore at 1000 hrs.\r\nPick up from Cruise terminal and transfer to hotel.\r\nEvening at leisure.\r\nAfternoon pick up for Sentosa island tour- offers a variety of attractions to provide\r\nvariety of experiences, recreation & entertainment to visitors. Sky ride - a chair lift which offers bird eye view of Sentosa island. Luge ride - features a self steering, gravity driven three wheel cart, Cable car, 4D Adventure, SEA Aquarium, Wings of time.\r\nOvernight at hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 06- Singapore Departure\r\nEnjoy breakfast at Hotel. Day at leisure.\r\n(Standard hotel check out time: 12pm)\r\nPick up from hotel lobby and transfer to airport for flight back to Delhi.','','- Economy class airfare on Singapore Airlines\r\n- Accommodation at the hotels mentioned or similar.\r\n- 03 nights Singapore stay with breakfast\r\n- 02 nights stay on Cruise (Genting Dream Cruise) Balcony Stateroom \r\n- All meals on Cruise\r\n- Airport - hotel- airport transfers\r\n- Hotel- cruise terminal- hotel transfers\r\n- Singapore city tour-03 hrs approx\r\n- All transfers & tours on seat in coach/ sharing basis\r\n- Singapore Visa Charges\r\n- Travel Insurance\r\n- Port charges\r\n- One time pick up & delivery is included.','- Dinner & Lunch\r\n- Gratuity of Cruise to be paid directly onboard cruise SGD 21 per person per night\r\n- Any Optional Tour.\r\n- Cost for shore excursion on port of halt of Cruise\r\n- Any type of personal expense\r\n- Any expense due to natural calamity or change in flight\r\n- TCS','','2023-06-27','2023-07-04',1,0,0,'2023-05-30 17:03:25','2023-05-30 19:48:28'),(326,739,54,4,0,0,91800,42500,'Singapore Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 01 (21 June)\r\nSingapore - Airport Arrival Transfer - PRIVATE\r\n\r\nDay 02 (22 June)\r\nSingapore City Orientation Drive \r\nAfternoon Sentosa (Inclusion Cable Car,Luge & Skyride,Wings of Time)\r\nReturn Transfers - SIC\r\n\r\nDay 03 (23 June)\r\nBird Paradise\r\nAround 4pm , pick up from hotel and transfer to Cruise terminal.\r\nCruise sailing starts at 8 pm.\r\nOnBoard Cruise\r\n\r\nDay 04 (24 June)\r\nStay at Cruise with cruise activities\r\n\r\nDay 05 (25 June)\r\nCruise arrives back to Singapore at 10:00 AM.\r\nPick up from Cruise terminal and transfer to hotel.\r\nNight Safari with Tram Ride - Return Transfers - SIC\r\n\r\nDay 06 (26 June)\r\nUniversal Studio\r\nReturn Transfers - SIC\r\n\r\nDay 07 (27 June)\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 08 (28 June)\r\nSingapore - Airport Departure Transfer - PRIVATE','','Economy class return airfare\r\n4 nights stay in the mentioned hotel\r\n4 breakfasts\r\n02 nights stay on Cruise (Genting Dream Cruise) Balcony Stateroom\r\nReturn Cruise Transfers – PVT\r\nReturn Airport Transfers – PVT  \r\nTours and sightseeing as mentioned in the itinerary\r\nVisa Charges\r\nTravel Insurance','Any type of personal expense\r\nAny expense due to natural calamity or change in flight\r\nAny meal other than mentioned above\r\nAnything which is not mentioned in inclusions\r\nTCS','The rates are subject to change','2023-06-21','2023-06-27',1,0,0,'2023-05-30 18:48:34','2023-06-01 16:14:05'),(327,738,15510,2,0,0,49000,25000,'Thailand Adventure','2N Krabi - 3N Phuket ','','Delhi-Phuket-Delhi Economy class return airfare\r\n02 Nights stay in Krabi\r\n03 Nights stay in Phuket\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\n03 Ways Transfers – PVT (Phuket Airport – Krabi Hotel – Phuket Hotel – Phuket Airport)\r\n4 Island Tour with Lunch (Speed Boat) + SIC Transfer (Not Incl. Park Fee)\r\nPhi Phi Island Tour  by Speed Boat + Khai Island + Indian Lunch + Transfer on SIC + National Park Free\r\nTravel Insurance','* Any meal other than that mentioned above\r\n* Expenditure of a personal nature such as drinks, souvenirs and laundry\r\n* Anything which is not mentioned in the inclusions\r\n* TCS','The flight fare is dynamic. ','2023-06-10','2023-06-15',1,0,0,'2023-05-30 18:56:31','2023-05-30 19:02:40'),(328,740,15526,4,0,0,66000,25000,'Kashmir Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 - ARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING (CHECK-IN HOTEL)	 	\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	 	\r\n			\r\nDay 2 - SONMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR	 	\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Sonamarg \"Golden Meadow\".  Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy horse riding upto Thajiwas glacier and sledge riding on snow (own cost). Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	 	\r\n			\r\nDay 3 - GULMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR	 	\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as “Meadow Of Flowers “ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.	 	\r\n			\r\nDay 4 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (1 NIGHT STAY)	 	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS “ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.	 	\r\n						\r\nDay 5 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT	 	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.	 	\r\n				\r\nDay 6 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT	 	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.	 	','','Economy class return airfare\r\nAccommodation  as above.\r\nBreakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\nAirport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis. \r\nSightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\nShikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat\r\nDriver Allowances\r\nVehicle: Innova (NON AC)\r\nToll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\nHotel Taxes\r\n','* Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n* Extra Meals\r\n* Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n* Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances. \r\n* Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n* Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n* Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc. \r\n','The rates are subject to change','2023-06-19','2023-06-24',1,0,0,'2023-05-31 14:44:27','2023-05-31 15:52:03'),(329,741,16260,2,0,0,240000,65000,'Europe Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: Arrive in Paris, meet Tour Manager, transfer to hotel for check-in.\r\nDay 2: Paris City Tour, Eiffel Tower visit, Seine River Cruise.\r\nDay 3: Travel to Switzerland, dinner at a local Indian restaurant, check-in at the hotel.\r\nDay 4: Free day in Switzerland or optional Mount Titlis excursion with Lucerne orientation tour.\r\nDay 5: Free day in Switzerland or optional Jungfraujoch excursion with visit to Interlaken.\r\nDay 6: Zurich orientation tour, travel to Innsbruck, visit Golden Roof and Swarovski, dinner at a restaurant, check-in at the hotel.\r\nDay 7: Travel to Venice, tour of Venice Island, visit St. Mark\'s Square and Basilica.\r\nDay 8: Travel to Rome, Rome city tour including Colosseum and Trevi Fountain.\r\nDay 9: Vatican City tour, drive to Pisa/Florence.\r\nDay 10: Visit the Leaning Tower of Pisa, departure from Milan Airport.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTentative Hotel Details:\r\n\r\n2 Nights in Paris or Surrounding Area:\r\n\r\n* Hotel Inn Paris CDG Airport\r\n* Golden Tulip Paris Aéroport CDG Villepinte\r\n* Hotel Du Parc Bougival\r\n* Mercure Paris Cdg Or Similar\r\n\r\n3 Nights in Zurich or Surrounding Area:\r\n\r\n* Novotel Zurich Airport Messe\r\n* Allegra Zurich Airport\r\n* Dorint Zurich Airport Or Similar\r\n\r\n1 Night in Innsbruck or Surrounding Area:\r\n\r\n* Ramada Tivoli\r\n* Alpenkonig Tirol\r\n* Belmoint\r\n* Bon Alpina or Similar\r\n\r\n1 Night in Venice/Padova or Surrounding Area:\r\n\r\n* Crowne Plaza Padova\r\n* NH Padova\r\n* IH Roma Z3\r\n* SB Padova\r\n* Best Western Air Venice\r\n* Four Points By Sheraton Padova or Similar\r\n\r\n1 Night in Rome:\r\n\r\n* Mercure Rome West\r\n* Rome Pisana Hotel\r\n* NH Hotel or Similar\r\n\r\n1 Night in Florence / Pisa:\r\n\r\n* The Gate\r\n* West Florence\r\n* Tower Inn Valdera or Similar','','* Cost of your round trip economy class airfare valid for the duration of the tour\r\n* Accommodation at the hotels mentioned or similar.\r\n* Breakfast & Dinner (as indicated on the itinerary)\r\n* Guided Paris City Tour with Eiffel Tower 2nd Level & Seine River Cruise\r\n* Venice Island Tour\r\n* Excursion to Pisa\r\n* Zurich orientation tour\r\n* Visit Swarovs