) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg.	 	\r\n				\r\n	\r\nDay 4 & 5 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (2 NIGHTS STAY)	 	\r\nDay 4- After breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS “ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. Day at leisure. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam. 	 	\r\n		\r\n		\r\nDay 5- After breakfast one can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.		\r\n		\r\n\r\nDay 6 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT	 	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.	 	\r\n				\r\n\r\nDay 7 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT	 	\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.	 	','','* Accommodation  as above.\r\n* Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\n* Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis. \r\n* Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\n* Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat\r\n* Driver Allowances.\r\n* Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n* Hotel Taxes','* Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n* Extra Meals\r\n* Cost of Union Cab services in Pahalgam, Gulmarg and Sonamarg.\r\n* Guide fees, Camera fees, shopping & any monument entrances. \r\n* Guest Entry Fee at Gulmarg / Aru.\r\n* Entrance fee for Mughal Gardens or for any Park/ Museum/Monument.\r\n* Expenses of personal nature such as laundry, mini bars, etc. \r\n','Airfare is dynamic.','2023-09-27','2023-10-03',1,0,0,'2023-06-20 15:12:03','2023-06-20 15:12:03'),(353,778,15526,2,0,0,36200,21000,'Kashmir - the heaven on earth','2N Srinagar - 1N Gulmarg - 1N Pahalgam - 1N Srinagar\r\n\r\n\r\nITINERARY\r\nDay 1 - ARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHTSEEING (CHECK-IN HOTEL)\r\n \r\nUpon arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer you to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of the Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), and Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at a hotel in Srinagar.\r\n \r\n \r\nDay 2 - SONMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Sonamarg \"Golden Meadow\".  Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of the Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy horse riding up to Thajiwas glacier and sledge riding on snow (own cost). Overnight stay at a hotel in Srinagar.\r\n \r\n \r\nDay 3 - CHECK-IN AT GULMARG (1 NIGHT STAY)\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg. Gulmarg is also known as “Meadow Of Flowers “ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-hole golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow-clad mountains, a Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view of the natural beauty of the summer and a full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at a hotel in Gulmarg.\r\n \r\n \r\nDay  4 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (1 NIGHT STAY)\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast check out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS “ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breathtaking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.\r\n \r\n \r\nDay 5 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast check out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in the evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.\r\n \r\n \r\nDay 6 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n \r\nAfter breakfast check out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.\r\n \r\n ','','✔ Delhi-Srinagar-Delhi Economy class airfare\r\n✔ accommodation  as above.\r\n✔ Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\n✔ Airport - pick-up and drop facility on a pvt basis.\r\n✔ Sightseeing by a non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\n✔ Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in the same houseboat\r\n✔ Driver Allowances.\r\n✔ Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry fee at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n✔ Hotel Taxes','✔ Cost of any adventure activities like Gondola Ride, Skiing, Motor Bike, River rafting, Pony / Sledge Ride etc.\r\n✔ Extra Meals - Meals not i