ee THB 200 PP)\r\n* Phi Phi Island Tour by Big Boat with Local Lunch on SIC (Excl. National Marine Park Fee)\r\n* Full Day James Bond Island Tour by Long Tailed Boat with Lunch with no Canoe Incl. National Marine Park FEE on SIC\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Travel Insurance','* TCS','Airfare is dynamic.','2023-09-21','2023-09-26',1,0,0,'2023-08-17 19:10:22','2023-08-18 13:22:45'),(409,870,15494,1,0,0,5400,2000,'Delhi-Goa-Delhi','\r\nNorth Goa \r\n\r\n* Fort Aguada\r\n* Dolpin trips\r\n* Candolim beach \r\n* Calangute Beach \r\n* Baga beach\r\n* Anjuna beach\r\n* Vagator beach\r\n\r\nSouth Goa\r\n\r\n* Old goa churches\r\n* Mangeshi temple\r\n* Spice plantation \r\n* Donapuala jetty\r\n* Miramar beach \r\n* Panajim shopping','','* 4 nights stay in the mentioned hotel\r\n* Return Airport Transfers.\r\n* Sightseeing Covered North and South Goa\r\n* Daily Breakfast','','','2023-09-07','2023-09-11',1,0,0,'2023-08-19 12:54:21','2023-08-19 12:54:21'),(410,871,126,2,0,0,0,0,'Jaipur-Jodhpur-Udaipur','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1: Arrival in Jaipur\r\nFlight from Delhi to Jaipur\r\nArrive in Jaipur and check into your hotel.\r\nVisit Hawa Mahal and explore the City Palace.\r\nEvening stroll in local markets like Johari Bazaar.\r\nOvernight stay in Jaipur.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 2: Jaipur Sightseeing\r\n\r\nBreakfast at hotel.\r\nMorning visit to Amber Fort and Jal Mahal.\r\nExplore Jantar Mantar and Albert Hall Museum.\r\nEvening free for leisure or more shopping.\r\nOvernight stay in Jaipur.\r\n\r\nDay 3: Jaipur to Jodhpur (via Ajmer)\r\n\r\nEarly morning breakfast and Check out from Jaipur hotel and travel to Jodhpur.\r\nVisit Ajmer Sharif Dargah en route.\r\nArrive in Jodhpur, check in, and visit Mehrangarh Fort.\r\nOvernight stay in Jodhpur.\r\n\r\nDay 4: Jodhpur to Udaipur (via Ranakpur)\r\n\r\nEarly morning breakfast and Check out from Jodhpur hotel and depart for Udaipur.\r\nVisit Ranakpur Jain Temple on the way.\r\nReach Udaipur, check in, and enjoy a boat ride on Lake Pichola.\r\nOvernight stay in Udaipur.\r\n\r\nDay 5: Udaipur Sightseeing\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from hotel and leave for Taj Lake Palace. Process the check-in. \r\nExplore City Palace, Saheliyon Ki Bari, and Folk Art Museum.\r\nOptionally, visit Sajjangarh (Monsoon Palace) for panoramic views.\r\nFree time for shopping and leisure.\r\nOvernight stay in Udaipur.\r\n\r\nDay 6: Udaipur Departure\r\n\r\nCheck out from the hotel and head to the sightseeing if left any. \r\nIn evening (around 5:30), drop at airport. \r\nFlight from Udaipur to Delhi\r\n','','Delhi-Jaipur and Udaipur-Delhi Economy class airfare\r\n5 nights accommodation at above mentioned hotels\r\nDaily breakfast\r\nAll transfers and sightseeing with an AC vehicle (Innova Crysta)\r\nToll Tax, Parking and Driver allowances\r\nGST','Anything which is not mentioned in Inclusions','The airfare is dynamic and hence  subject to vary.\r\nThe rooms are subject to availability. \r\nThis quotation does not represent any booking. ','2023-11-18','2023-11-23',1,0,0,'2023-08-20 18:54:11','2023-08-20 18:54:11'),(411,872,349,5,0,0,213752,25000,'Dubai Diaries','Day wise Itinerary –\r\n\r\n20 jan -Arrival transfers + Lotus cruise Marina With Dinner\r\n21 jan -Dubai Half Day City Tour + Burj Khalifa Evening slot \r\n22 jan -Future museum + Dubai Frame\r\n23 jan -Aqua venture & The Lost Chambers Aquarium\r\n24 jan -Miracle Garden + Global Village + Desert Safari with bbq dinner\r\n25 jan -Farari world + Abu Dhabi City Tour + Abu Dhabi Grand Mosque \r\n26 jan -Departure Transfers\r\n\r\n','','* 6 nights stay in the mentioned hotel\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Dubai half day city tour on sic\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner on sic\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sic\r\n* Burj khalifa 124 floor non prime ticket on sic\r\n* Future museum + Dubai Frame\r\n* Frari world + Abu Dhabi City Tour + Abu Dhabi Grand Mosque  \r\n* Aqua venture & lost Chamber\r\n* Miracle Garden\r\n* Global Village\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n','TCS','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-01-20','2024-01-26',1,0,0,'2023-08-21 12:38:26','2023-08-21 18:03:12'),(412,873,349,5,0,0,213752,25000,'Dubai Diaries','Day wise Itinerary –\r\n\r\n20 jan -Arrival transfers + Lotus cruise Marina With Dinner\r\n21 jan -Dubai Half Day City Tour + Burj Khalifa Evening slot \r\n22 jan -Future museum + Dubai Frame\r\n23 jan -Aqua venture & The Lost Chambers Aquarium\r\n24 jan -Miracle Garden + Global Village + Desert Safari with bbq dinner\r\n25 jan -Farari world + Abu Dhabi City Tour + Abu Dhabi Grand Mosque \r\n26 jan -Departure Transfers\r\n\r\n','','* 6 nights stay in the mentioned hotel\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Dubai half day city tour on sic\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner on sic\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sic\r\n* Burj khalifa 124 floor non prime ticket on sic\r\n* Future museum + Dubai Frame\r\n* Frari world + Abu Dhabi City Tour + Abu Dhabi Grand Mosque  \r\n* Aqua venture & lost Chamber\r\n* Miracle Garden\r\n* Global Village\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n','TCS','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-01-20','2024-01-26',1,0,0,'2023-08-21 19:48:34','2023-08-21 19:48:34'),(413,874,15512,4,0,0,160000,35000,'Vietnam Package','2N Hanoi - 2N Ho Chi Minh City\r\n\r\nSuggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 1 - Sept 3: Hanoi Arrival & City Tour (B)\r\nMeet guide at Noi Bai airport, transfer to downtown.\r\nVisit Temple of Literature and choose a museum/temple.\r\nCyclo trip around Hoan Kiem Lake & Old Quarter.\r\nChance to immerse in Hanoi\'s culture. Tour ends 4:30 PM.\r\nOvernight in Hanoi.\r\nInclusion: Private transfer, guide, entrance, breakfast, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 2 - Sept 4: Halong Bay 1-Day Tour (B, L)\r\n7 AM: Transfer to Halong port by shared van.\r\nCruise journey through Halong Bay\'s beauty.\r\nExplore caves, kayaking, Titov Island visit.\r\nSunset Party on cruise. Return by 5:30-6 PM.\r\nOvernight in Hanoi.\r\nInclusion: Transfer, guide on boat, entrance, meals, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 3 - Sept 5: Hanoi - Flight to Ho Chi Minh City - City Tour (B)\r\nBreakfast, transfer to airport, fly to Ho Chi Minh City.\r\nAfternoon: Explore Cho Lon market, pagoda, landmarks.\r\nTour ends around 5:30 PM.\r\nOvernight in Ho Chi Minh City.\r\nInclusion: Private transfer, entrance, breakfast, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 4 - Sept 6: Mekong Delta Tour (B)\r\nDrive to Mekong Delta, boat through canals, islands.\r\nVisit Unicorn Island, taste fruits, local music.\r\nExplore Ben Tre, coconut candy making, honey tasting.\r\nReturn to Ho Chi Minh City at leisure.\r\nInclusion: Transfer, guide, entrance, boat, breakfast, hotel.\r\n\r\nDay 5 - Sept 7: Departure from HCMC\r\nFree time until airport transfer. Farewell!\r\nInclusion: Transfer, breakfast.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n','','Delhi-Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh-Delhi economy class airfare\r\nAir ticket cost from Hanoi to Ho Chi Minh\r\nAccommodation in the mentioned hotels\r\nMeals as mentioned in the itinerary\r\nDay Cruise in Ha Long Bay\r\nAll sight seeing and tours on pvt transfers\r\nSIC tours as mentioned\r\nEntrance fee to the mentioned itinerary\r\nBottled water for the touring day (500ml/bottle/pax/day)\r\nTravel Insurance','Early Check-in and Late Check-out\r\nPersonal expenses\r\nSurcharge in Peak Season (Christmas, New Year, Lunar New Year etc.)\r\nTips ($3 per person/per day)\r\nVisa\r\nAnything which is not mentioned in inclusions. ','The flight fare is dynamic. Hence, it is subject to change.\r\nThe rooms are subject to availability.\r\nThis quotation doesn\'t confirms any booking. ','2023-09-03','2023-09-07',1,0,0,'2023-08-22 23:23:49','2023-08-22 23:23:49'),(414,877,419,4,1,0,70000,20000,'Kashmir Diaries','Day wise Itinerary –\r\n\r\nDay 1 - ARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING (CHECK-IN HOTEL)\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDay 2 - SONMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Sonamarg \"Golden Meadow\".  Sonmarg lies in Sind Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. Sonmarg is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lakes. Enjoy horse riding upto Thajiwas glacier and sledge riding on snow (own cost). Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDay 3 - CHECK-IN AT GULMARG (1 NIGHT STAY)\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as “Meadow Of Flowers “ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Gulmarg.\r\n \r\nDay 4 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (1 NIGHT STAY)\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS “ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. One can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 6 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.\r\n\r\n','','* Economy class Airfare.\r\n* Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\n* Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis.\r\n* Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\n* Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat\r\n* Driver Allowances.\r\n* Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n* Hotel Taxes\r\n\r\n','','Airfare is dynamic.','2023-12-13','2023-12-18',1,0,0,'2023-08-23 17:36:27','2023-08-23 18:17:39'),(415,878,15510,2,0,0,30000,11000,'Thailand Diaries','','','* Economy Class Airfare\r\n* Phuket Airport to Phuket Hotel Transfers – PVT \r\n* Phuket Hotel to Krabi Hotel Transfers – PVT \r\n* Krabi Hotel to Phuket Airport Transfers – PVT\r\n* Phi Phi Island Tour by Big Boat with Local Lunch on SIC (Excl. National Marine Park Fee) – SIC\r\n* Krabi 4 Island Tour by Long Tailed Boat + Lunch Box (Exclude the National Park Admission Fee THB 200 PP) – SIC \r\n* Half Day BKK Temple & City Tour (2 TEMPLE) – SIC\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n\r\n','* TCS','Airfare is dynamic.','2024-02-02','2024-02-07',1,0,0,'2023-08-24 11:42:16','2023-08-24 11:42:16'),(416,881,15595,3,0,0,65500,4000,'Sri Lanka Diaries','Suggested Itinerary:\r\n\r\nDay 01\r\n\r\nPick up from BIA & transfer to Batticoloa\r\nCheck in at the hotel\r\nVehicle on disposal (80KM)\r\nOvernight stay in Batticaloa\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDay 02\r\n\r\nBrerakfast at the hotel\r\nProceed to Nuwara Eliya\r\nVisit Ashok Vatika & Seetha Amman Temple\r\nOvernight stay in Nuwara Eliya\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 03\r\n\r\nBreakfast at the hotel\r\nProceed to Kandy\r\nEn-route visit Hanuman Ji Temple & Ramboda Water fall\r\nVisit Tea Factory\r\nCheck in the hotel\r\nEvening City tour of Kandy\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDay 04\r\n\r\nBreakfast at the hotel\r\nTransfer to Colombo\r\nEn-route visit Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage\r\nCity tour of Colombo\r\nDeparture transfer to Airport','','* Accommodation at the above mentioned hotels or similar\r\n* Meet & Assist at the airport\r\n* City tours & sightseeing as per the above itinerary\r\n* Meals as stated above.\r\n* An air-conditioned vehicle with an English speaking driver throughout the tour\r\n* All applicable Gov. Taxes\r\n* Map of Sri Lanka\r\n* Room upgrade on availability\r\n* 02 X 500 ML water bottle per person per day.\r\n* Welcome at the airport with Garlands\r\n* Express way charges wherever applicable.\r\n','* Airfare & VISA charges\r\n* Entrance fees to any sites not mentioned above\r\n* Tips & portages\r\n* Any meals not mentioned above\r\n* Any other services not mentioned above\r\n* Early check in & Late check out','','2023-09-27','2023-10-01',0,0,0,'2023-08-25 11:30:55','2023-08-25 11:46:52'),(417,883,16260,2,0,0,117823,31502,'Europe Package','20N/21D in Europe','','Accommodation\r\n\r\nDaily Breakfast\r\n\r\n15 Days Swiss Pass in 2nd class (Continuous)\r\n\r\nExcursion to Jungfraujoch -Top of Europe (with Swiss Pass)\r\n\r\nExcursion to Mt. Titlis with Ice Flyer (with Swiss Pass)\r\n\r\nExcursion to Matterhorn Glacier Paradise \r\n\r\nVisit Rhine Falls with Swiss Pass (tickets will have to be purchased there only)\r\n\r\nVisit Lake Lucerne Cruise with Swiss pass\r\n\r\nVisit Lake Breinz with Swiss pass\r\n','* Any meal other than the mentioned above\r\n* Any transfer or sightseeing other than mentioned above\r\n* TCS (5%)\r\n','- Rates & Availability Is Subject To Change At The Time Of Booking.\r\n- City & Government Tax To Be Paid Locally On Spot.\r\n- For The Above Said Tour, There Is No Pick Up And Drop Off From The Hotel, So Client Will Have To Reach At Departure Points And Back To Hotel Also At Their Own Arrangement.\r\n- Above Mentioned Excursions Are Unescorted.\r\n- Rate Is Subject To Change If There Are Changes On Number Of Pax, Number Of Nights Or Change Of Travelling Date.\r\n- No Booking Has Been Made Yet\r\n_ Train fare and seats are subject to availability.','2023-09-18','2023-10-08',0,0,0,'2023-08-26 14:10:22','2023-08-26 16:45:41'),(418,884,349,3,0,0,37500,10000,'Dubai Diaries','Day wise Itinerary –\r\n\r\n08 Sep– Arrival transfers \r\n09 Sep –Dubai Half Day City Tour on sic.\r\n10 Sep -Desert Safari with bbq dinner on sic.\r\n11 Sep -Dhow cruise Creek With Dinner on sic.\r\n12 Sep -Departure Transfers\r\n\r\n','','* 4 nights stay in the mentioned hotel\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Dubai half day city tour on sic\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner on sic\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sic\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Airport Transfers on Pvt.\r\n* Visa','TCS','Airfare is dynamic.','2023-09-08','2023-09-12',1,0,0,'2023-08-28 13:53:27','2023-08-28 14:09:18'),(419,885,419,8,0,0,205600,30000,'Kashmir Files','02 nights Srinagar\r\n\r\n02 nights Pahalgam\r\n\r\n01 night Srinagar\r\n\r\nITINERARY\r\n\r\nDay 1 - ARRIVAL + SRINAGAR LOCAL SIGHSEEING (CHECK-IN HOTEL)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport, our representative will meet you to pick you up and transfer to your hotel. Welcome to Srinagar, the Lake City. Begin your tour of \'Exotic Kashmir. After check-in proceed to Local Sightseeing of Srinagar with a tour of Mughal Gardens visiting Cheshmashahi (the royal spring), Nishat (the garden of pleasure), Shalimar (the abode of love), Pari Mahal. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDay 2 - GULMARG DAY TRIP  FROM SRINAGAR\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast leave from hotel and proceed to Gulmarg . Gulmarg is also known as “Meadow Of Flowers “ & has a famous Golf course during summer  (which is one if the highest 18-holes golf course in the world) & Ski Resort during winter. One can enjoy the breathtaking views of snow clad mountains, Gondola (cable car) ride from Gulmarg to Khilanmarg (own cost) to have a real view in natural beauty of the summer and full snow view in winter. You can have a pony ride in the open fields to seven springs (own cost) and to a lake, which remains frozen until June. Overnight stay at hotel in Srinagar.\r\n\r\nDay 3 & 4 - CHECK-IN AT PAHALGAM (2 NIGHTS STAY)\r\n\r\nDay 3- After breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Pahalgam hotel, VILLAGE OF SHEPHERDS “ Pahalgam is known as the land of shepherds. The mountain town is located along the bank of River Lidder. Here you can visit many breath taking places enroute visiting the world famous Saffron  growing  fields . Pahalgam is famous for Indian film industry, some trekking routes & also base camp for Amarnath pilgrimage. Day at leisure. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.\r\n\r\n \r\nDay 4- After breakfast one can visit chandanwari,  Betab Valley and Aru Valley (own cost) has a fine Meadows of Picturesque scenery & starting point of trekking of Liddarwat , Kolahoi Glacier , Tarsar Lake. Overnight stay at hotel in Pahalgam.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5 - CHECK-IN AT SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from hotel and transfer to Srinagar. Upon arrival check-in houseboat. After rest in evening enjoy Shikara Ride on Dal lake for 1 hour and explore the beauty of the lake. Overnight stay at houseboat in Srinagar.\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 6 - CHECK-OUT FROM SRINAGAR HOUSEBOAT\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast check-out from Srinagar houseboat and transfer to Srinagar Airport to board the flight for onward destination.\r\n\r\n','','✔ DEL-SXR-DEL economy class airfare\r\n\r\n✔ accommodation  as above.\r\n\r\n✔ Breakfast and Dinner in the hotel.\r\n\r\n✔ Airport - pick-up and drop facility on pvt basis.\r\n\r\n✔ Sightseeing by non-AC vehicle on pvt basis\r\n\r\n✔ Shikara Ride (01 hour) will be given in same houseboat\r\n\r\n✔ Driver Allowances.\r\n\r\n✔ Toll tax and State tax & Parking (Without Guest entry free at Gulmarg & Aru)\r\n\r\n✔ Hotel Taxes','✔ Cos