 - Singapore and Malaysia\r\n* Phi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat + Khai Island- Transfer on SIC \r\n* Travel Insurance','TCS','Airfare is dynamic.','2023-10-19','2023-10-27',1,0,0,'2023-09-11 18:53:44','2023-09-11 19:28:26'),(439,909,15512,3,0,0,141625,40000,'Vietnam Diaries','\r\nDay 1 - 14 Nov: Arrival in Hanoi, Vietnam\r\n\r\nMeet and greet at Noi Bai International Airport\r\nTransfer to Hanoi downtown for early check-in\r\nExplore Dong Xuan Market, Old Quarter, Ngoc Son Temple\r\nCyclo tour around Hoan Kiem Lake and Old Quarter\r\nEvening at leisure\r\nOvernight in Hanoi\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 2 - 15 Nov: Wonderful Ninh Binh (B)\r\n\r\nDepart for Ninh Binh at 8:00 AM (2-hour drive)\r\nTam Coc rowboat trip through karst landscape and caves\r\nVisit Hoa Lu, Vietnam\'s ancient capital\r\nReturn to Hanoi in the evening\r\nOvernight in Hanoi\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 3 - 16 Nov: Explore Halong Bay 1 Day (SIC) (B, L)\r\n\r\nTransfer to Halong Port\r\nBoard the cruise to explore Halong Bay\r\nVisit Sung Sot Cave and Luon Cave\r\nKayaking in the bay\r\nStop at Titov Island for panoramic views\r\nSunset Party on the cruise\r\nReturn to Tuan Chau Port and transfer back to Hanoi\r\nOvernight in Hanoi\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 4 - 17 Nov: Hanoi Heritage - Flight to Da Nang (B)\r\n\r\nVisit Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum and Temple of Literature\r\nTransfer to the airport for a flight to Da Nang\r\nCheck-in at the hotel upon arrival\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 5 - 18 Nov: Ba Na Hill - Golden Bridge Full Day (B)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at your hotel at 8:00 AM\r\nTransfer to Ba Na Hills (35km from Danang)\r\nExplore Ba Na Hills with Sunworld Cable Car\r\nVisit By Night station, Vong Nguyet Hills, Linh Ung Pagoda, and more\r\nWalk on the famous Golden Bridge with panoramic views\r\nEnjoy activities at Fantasy Park\r\nOvernight in Da Nang\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 6 - 19 Nov: Hoi An Sightseeing (B)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at the hotel\r\nVisit Marble Mountain, explore caves, pagodas, and Stone Carving Village\r\nExplore Hoi An Ancient Town, walk by the Thu Bon River\r\nStop at the Japanese Covered Bridge and Fujian Assembly Hall\r\nEnjoy shopping at the Hoi An lantern market and dinner\r\nOvernight in Hoi An\r\n\r\n\r\nDay 7 - 20 Nov: Hoi An Departure (B)\r\n\r\nBreakfast at the hotel\r\nTransfer to the airport for your flight back to Hanoi and onward connection\r\nFarewell, and hope to see you again soon!','','* Economy class airfare\r\n* Accommodation based on triple sharing room.\r\n* Daily Breakfast.\r\n* Private air-conditioned vehicle with private driver as mentioned itinerary\r\n* Local English speaking guide as mentioned itinerary\r\n* SIC tours as mentioned\r\n* Entrance fee to the mentioned itinerary\r\n* Bottled water for the touring day (500ml/bottle/pax/day)\r\n* Meet & Greet assistance at the airport in Bali.\r\n* Return Airport & inter hotel transfer by Pvt Basis in Bali.\r\n* Transfers with air-conditioned vehicle in Bali.\r\n* English speaking driver cum guide assistance in Bali.\r\n* Inernal flight cost included\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n','* Early check in/Late check out not mentioned in the itinerary\r\n* Personal expenses\r\n* Tips ($3 per person/per way - mandatory to be paid there)\r\n* Visa Charges\r\n* TCS','Airfare is Dynamic.\r\nRooms are subject to availability.','2023-11-14','2023-11-20',1,0,0,'2023-09-12 11:37:58','2023-09-15 15:14:38'),(441,912,126,2,0,0,0,0,'Jaipur-Jodhpur-Udaipur','\r\nDaywise Itinerary\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n1st Day (18th Nov Saturday) : Jaipur - Arrival\r\n\r\n·         Upon arrival at airport, meet our representative and take a transfer to the hotel.\r\n\r\n·        Jaipur is the capital of Rajasthan. It was painted in pink shading a century back to pay tribute to a meeting sovereign. This city is 260 years of age and was built by Maharaja Jai Singh.\r\n\r\n·        Upon your arrival, complete your check-in process.\r\n\r\n·        Get relaxed & take rest at the hotel.\r\n\r\n·        After getting a rest visit Albert Hall followed by Birla Temple.\r\n\r\n·        Head back to the hotel in evening for rest OR you can spend the evening shopping for antiques and crafts in nearby market. Take a stroll through the streets and enjoy the vivid, rich beauty of the city on your own.\r\n\r\nDinner and overnight stay at Jaipur\r\n\r\n2nd Day (19th Nov Sunday) : Jaipur - Sightseeing\r\n\r\nEarly Morning After breakfast, head out for a guided Jaipur City Tour, visit the Amber Fort First. Also, visit the Jal Mahal & Jantar Mantar. Toward the evening, go for a touring voyage through Jaipur. Also visit Maharaja’s City Palace. Drive past the Hawa Mahal. Dinner & Overnight at Jaipur Hotel.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n3rd Day (20th Nov Monday) : Jaipur to Jodhpur - Transfer\r\n\r\nAfter breakfast, check-out from the hotel. Then transfer to the Jodhpur. After Arrival Complete your easy check-in processes and relax in your bed. Jodhpur is a beautiful city that displays the rich crafts and culture of Rajasthan.Visit Jaswant Thada. This is a marble cenotaph built in 1899, in remembrance of Maharaja Jaswant Singh II. And then head to Mehrangarh Fort. Rising opposite and secure from a slope which is 125 meters over Jodhpur’s horizon is the Mehrangarh Fort. This memorable fortification is a standout amongst the most well known in India and is stuffed with history and legends. Mehrangarh Fort still bears the engravings of cannonball assaults used by the armed forces of Jaipur on its second entryway.(If time permits) Evening is free for leisure. Overnight stay at Jodhpur Hotel.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n4th Day (21st Nov Tuesday) : Jodhpur to Udaipur - Sightseeing and Transfer\r\n\r\nAfter Breakfast check-out from the hotel . Later drive to Udaipur. Upon your arrival, complete your check-in process. Get Relaxed. Head back to the hotel for the night. Dinner & Overnight stay at Udaipur.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n5th Day (22nd Nov Wednesday) : Udaipur - Sightseeing\r\n\r\nBegin your day with breakfast at the hotel and then start your city tour. Visit the City Palace which is the biggest castle complex in Rajasthan. Partake in the boat ride on the tranquil waters of Lake Pichola. Also visit Sahelion ki Bari or Garden of the Maids of Honor, Jagdish sanctuary. Local Market Visit. Later in the evening Fateh Sagar Lake, Shilpgram.Once sightseeing is over, head back to the hotel. Dinner & Overnight stay at Udaipur.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n6th Day (23rd Nov Thursday) : Udaipur - Departure\r\n\r\nAfter Breakfast check-out from the Hotel Visit MAHARANA PRATAP MEMORIAL with local market visit and take a transfer to Udaipur Airport as you will be heading back to your home with the good memory.','','Delhi-Jaipur and Udaipur-Delhi Economy class airfare\r\n5 nights accommodation at above mentioned hotels\r\nDaily breakfast\r\nAll transfers and sightseeing with an AC vehicle (Innova Crysta)\r\nToll Tax, Parking and Driver allowances\r\nGST','Anything which is not mentioned in Inclusions','The airfare is dynamic and hence  subject to vary.\r\nThe rooms are subject to availability. \r\nThis quotation does not represent any booking. ','2023-11-18','2023-11-23',1,0,0,'2023-09-13 16:47:39','2023-09-14 13:37:01'),(442,913,349,4,0,0,84992,10000,'Dubai Diaries','Day wise Itinerary –\r\n\r\n19 Oct -Arrival transfers\r\n22 Oct -Dubai Half Day City Tour + Burj Khalifa Evening slot\r\n21 Oct -Marina cruis With Dinner\r\n22 Oct- Farari world + Abu Dhabi City Tour + Abu Dhabi Grand Mosque\r\n23 Oct -Desert Safari with bbq dinner\r\n24 Oct -Day at leisure\r\n25 Oct -Departure Transfers\r\n','','* 6 nights stay in the mentioned hotel\r\n* Daily Breakfast\r\n* Dubai half day city tour on sic\r\n* Desert safari with bbq dinner on sic\r\n* Marina Dhow Cruise with dinner on sic\r\n* Burj khalifa 124 floor non prime ticket on sic\r\n* Frari world + Abu Dhabi City Tour + Abu Dhabi Grand Mosque\r\n* Travel Insurance\r\n* Visa\r\n\r\n','TCS','','2023-10-19','2023-10-25',1,0,0,'2023-09-14 12:20:00','2023-09-14 13:37:35'),(443,915,349,4,0,0,88000,10000,'Dubai Diaries','Day wise Itinerary –\r\n\r\n19 